<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="REV" style="id">- Uumukwo - Matumbi Bible Version</book>
  <para style="h">UUMUKWO</para>
  <para style="toc1">Uumukwo wa Yoani</para>
  <para style="toc2">Uumukwo</para>
  <para style="toc3">Uum</para>
  <para style="mt1">Uumukwo wa Yoani</para>
  <para style="mt2">Uumukwo wa Yoani</para>
  <para style="imt">Kilongolyo</para>
  <para style="ip">Kitabu sa Uumukwo nga kitabu sa kuundi'la mu itabu ya Lilagano Lyayambi'. Kwa mwandiki Yoani saai kitabu sake sa kuundi'la saakiandike mwaka wa 95 bu'ka po belekwa kwa Yesu Kilisitu (1:1). Ywembe ngaywakiandike kitabu sa Injili kati mwaiandikilwe na Yoani, na balua itatu, yani 1 Yoani, 2 Yoani na 3 Yoani. Kai', Yoani aatanganikwe panga mundu ywaapendilwe na Yesu (Yoani 13:23). Ywembe aakiandike kitabu sa Uumukwo paabi'kilwe kuutabilwe kukisiwa sa Patmo kwo bu'kana na lyalyaabonekine panga likosa lya kuinwaya Abali Inannoga ya Yesu Kilisitu (1:9).</para>
  <para style="ip">Kitumbu sa Yoani kukiandika kitabu sa Uumukwo sai, li'nga kwasenga myoyo babasoma bayendeli tama kwa Yesu Kilisitu kwo aminika na kwapeya imani yo u'bi'lya kwa mwanjaa, isa kwa Yesu Kilisitu kwendaegelya (1:13, 22:7). Balua yi' aiandike kwa mayumu, yani kwa Akilisitu boti na muno muno kwa makanisa saba gaagatambwa mu kipungu sa 2 mpaka 3. Yoani abi'ka mwasu wake wo laya panga akiandike mwene kwa kukitina, “Uumukwo” (1:3) na atumya mpwano wa ili'be mbali'mbali' yaibonekana kila pandu nkati ya kitabu sake li'nga kugabaya wiso gaagabweni. Kitabu si' kilandana na mwi'ngi' mwa itabu ya Lilagano lya Kwai'mbu', muno mukitabu sa Zakalia 6:1-8. Mapenga saba na mabakuli saba galandana na yi'lu' ngu'su'mbu' yailetilwe na Nnu'ngu' kwo binia kuipwatya Misili (Kutoka 7-9). Kitabu sa Uumukwo kilongelya abali ya kuundi'la wa dunia no laya panga Yesu ngaywaalu'a baa nsindi na balu' boti bababi'ka liu'bi'lyo lyabe kwake ywembe, baalu'a tama pamope nakwe milele. Uyi'ki'ti kitabu si' kikulaye na kukupeya liu'bi'lyo lya kakape kwa mwanjaa ki'li'bu'ka kwa Yesu kwendaegelya.</para>
  <para style="iot">Mutasali</para>
  <para style="io1">1. Yoani atumbwa kwa kwitapa panga ywembe nyai na mu'lu' mwapoki ulondoli <char style="ior">(<ref loc="REV 1:1-20">1:1-1:20</ref>)</char>.</para>
  <para style="io1">2. Apiya liyi'gi'yo lyalibu'ka mpu'la kwa Yesu, yenda ku makanisa saba <char style="ior">(<ref loc="REV 2:1-3:22">2:1-3:22</ref>)</char>.</para>
  <para style="io1">3. Alongelya abali ya miuli saba <char style="ior">(<ref loc="REV 4:1-8:5">4:1-8:5</ref>)</char> na mapenga saba <char style="ior">(<ref loc="REV 8:6-11:19">8:6-11:19</ref>)</char>.</para>
  <para style="io1">4. Yoani alongelya abali ya ngondo kati ya mwana nnalu'me na ling'ambo lyene mitwe saba <char style="ior">(<ref loc="REV 12:1-14:20">12:1-14:20</ref>)</char>.</para>
  <para style="io1">5. Aandika abali ya mabakuli saba ga nyongo ya Nnu'ngu' <char style="ior">(<ref loc="REV 15:1-16:21">15:1-16:21</ref>)</char>.</para>
  <para style="io1">6. Yoani aawanikia mu'lu' Nnu'ngu' mwasinda ngondo kwa andumu bake kunani <char style="ior">(<ref loc="REV 17:1-20:15">17:1-20:15</ref>)</char>.</para>
  <para style="io1">7. Yoani alongelya abali ya kunani kwaayambi' na nni'ma wayambi' wawaaisa kuundi'la <char style="ior">(<ref loc="REV 21:1-22:21">21:1-22:21</ref>)</char>.</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="REV 1" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 1:1" />Wu'no nga uumukwo waupiyite Yesu Kilisitu, waapeyilwe na Nnu'ngu' li'nga aalaye atumisi bake makowe gagapalikwa pitya pamasu'ba gano ga papipi. Kilisitu antumike malaika wake li'nga annaye ntumisi wake Yoani makowe go. <verse eid="REV 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 1:2" />Nembe Yoani akong'ondelya goti gaagabweni bu'kana na mayi'gi'yo gagabu'ka kwa Nnu'ngu' na ukong'ondeli wa Yesu Kilisitu. <verse eid="REV 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 1:3" />Nantali yake mundu ywasoma kitabu si'no sene mayi'gi'yo ga kilondoli, na nantali yabe babayu'wa no kamwa gagaandikilwe mono, kwa mwanjaa nsimu wa makowe gano wegelile.<verse eid="REV 1:3" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Salamu kwa makanisa saba</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 1:4" />Nenga na Yoani nigaandikya makanisa saba gagabile kunkoa wa Asia. Ninnu'byanga ngu'ngu' na amani bu'ka kwake ywembe ywabile nambi'yambi', ywaabile na ywaisa, no bu'ka kwa loo saba yaibile nnu'ngi' ya kiti'gu' sake sa lenji, <verse eid="REV 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 1:5" />no bu'ka kwa Yesu Kilisitu nkong'ondeli mwu'bi'li'ka, ywalongoli yu'yi'lwa bu'ka kwa awi'li na nga ntawala wa akulungwa boti ba padunia. Ywembe endatupenda, na kwa myai yake aatuyu'wi bu'ka muutabilwe wa sambi, <verse eid="REV 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 1:6" />ngaatupanga twenga panga ukulungwa na api'ndo ba dini, tuntumikiye Nnu'ngu' Tati' bake. Kwa Yesu Kilisitu ube utukupu na makakala, milele na milele! Amina.<verse eid="REV 1:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 1:7" />Lingulya! Endaisa na maunde!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="REV 1:7">Kila mundu ammona, na ata balu' babamwomike.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="REV 1:7">Makabila goti ga dunia gaalu'a lombola kwa kitumbu sake.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="REV 1:7">Eloo! Amina.<verse eid="REV 1:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 1:8" />“Nenga nga na Alfa na Omega, Nnongoi na ywa Kuundi'la,” abaya Bwana Nnu'ngu' ywabile nambi'yambi', ywaabile na ywaaisa, Mwene Makakala Goti!<verse eid="REV 1:8" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Maloto ga Mwana wa Mundu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 1:9" />Nenga na Yoani nannongo winu, nanipangite kiselele pamope na mwenga bu'kana na Yesu mungu'su'mbu', ukulungwa no komeya kwake. Naabile kukisiwa sakikemelwa Patmo kwa kitumbu sa liyi'gi'yo lya Nnu'ngu' na kunkong'ondelya Yesu. <verse eid="REV 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 1:10" />Lisu'ba limo lya Bwana, Loo Mpeleteu aatiniulukya. Nganiyu'wa lilobe liku'lu' kusu'gu' yangu' lyaliyu'wanike kati lipenga. <verse eid="REV 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 1:11" />Nalyembe lyaatibaya, “Ugaandike mukitabu galu' gaugabona na ugapeleke kwa makanisa saba, Efeso, Simurina, Pergamumu, Tiatila, Sarde, Filadelfia na Laodikia.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="REV 1:11">
    <figure style="fig" alt="Lamps 7 on stands - BK00154" file="Lamps(7)OnStands_Rev4.5_BK00154.tif" size="col" copy="Illustrations by Horace Knowles revised by Louise Bass © The British &amp; Foreign Bible Society, 1994." ref="1:11" /> <verse eid="REV 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 1:12" />Bai, nganigalambuka li'nga ninnole aywo ywalongela na nenga, nganiibona inala saba ya imulikyo ya zaabu. <verse eid="REV 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 1:13" />Na pakatikati ya yi'lu' inala kwabile na mundu kati Mwana wa Mundu, nembe aaweti nganju ndaso na nkanda wa zaabu pakyuba. <verse eid="REV 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 1:14" />Nywili yake yaabile uu muno kati lukanda lwa pamba, na minyo gake gang'alang'atya kati malimi ga mwoto, <verse eid="REV 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 1:15" />magu'lu' gake kati kyu'ma sakimelemeteyilwe kwo yoselwa pamwoto, na lilobe lyake lyaai kati mwagayota masi' gambone gagabutuka. <verse eid="REV 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="REV 1:16" />Muluboko lwake lwamalyo aabile na ndondwa saba na munkano wake lyaapitike lipanga lyalitema ku'no na ku'no. Kuminyo yake kwaating'alang'atya kati lisu'ba.<verse eid="REV 1:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="REV 1:17" />Bai, panimweni, nganitu'mbu'kya pamagu'lu' gake kati mundu ywawile. Ngabi'ka luboko lwake lwamalyo panani yangu' kabaya, “Kaneuyogope! Nenga Nannongoi na ywa Kuundi'la. <verse eid="REV 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="REV 1:18" />Nenga na mwu'mi! Naatiwaa, lakini lingulya, nambi'yambi' na mwu'mi milele na milele! Na nibile na iyu'gu'lyo ya kiwo na ya kumambi'. <verse eid="REV 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="REV 1:19" />Bai, ugaandike makowe ga gaugabona, makowe gagapitya nambi'yambi' na gagaalu'a pitya nnu'ngi'. <verse eid="REV 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="REV 1:20" />Asi' nga kilombolyo sakiiyilwe sa yi'lu' ndondwa saba na inala saba ya imulikyo ya zaabu yawibweni. Inala saba nga makanisa saba. Ndondwa saba nga malaika bake.”<verse eid="REV 1:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="REV 2" />
  <para style="s">Salamu kwa Efeso</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 2:1" />“Kwa malaika wa kanisa lya Efeso wandike,</para>
  <para style="pi" vid="REV 2:1">Nenga nanikamwa yi'lu' ndondwa saba muluboko lwangu' lwamalyo na nganityanga pakatikati ya inala saba ya imulikyo ya zaabu. Mugapi'kani ganimmakia! <verse eid="REV 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 2:2" />Niitangite ili'be yoti yamupanga, kasana kwinu no komeya kwinu. Nitangite panga muwesali kwayi'ki'tya bandu alau, mutikwapekeseni balu' babaikema atumilwe na kumbe atumilwe lili, na mwenga mukwipwile panga abu'su' bai. <verse eid="REV 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 2:3" />Kai', nitangite panga mutiku'su'mbu'lwa muno kwa kitumbu sangu' lakini mutikomeya, na munatotokelwali. <verse eid="REV 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 2:4" />Lakini nibile na kikowe sangali yi'ki'tyana na mwenga, panga muulei upendo winu wa patumbu kwangu'. <verse eid="REV 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 2:5" />Bai, muku'mbu'ki panga kwaku' kwamutu'mbwike li'nga mukanng'alambuki Nnu'ngu' no panga iyendo yamwabile nayo patumbu. Lakini mana mukotwike panga nnyo, naisa kasinu kukibu'ya kinala sa kimulikyo sinu pakibile. <verse eid="REV 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 2:6" />Lakini ubile na likowe limo lyanikulumba, panga wisukya iyendo ya Anikolai kati mwaniisukya nenga.<verse eid="REV 2:6" /></para>
  <para style="pi">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 2:7" />Ywabile na makutu go yu'wa, na ayu'we galu' Loo agabakia makanisa. Babaasinda naayalya lyaa, itunda ya nkongo wa ukoto waubile mukyati' sa Nnu'ngu'.<verse eid="REV 2:7" /></para>
  <para style="s">Salamu kwa Simurina</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 2:8" />“Kwa malaika wa kanisa lya Simurina wandike,</para>
  <para style="pi" vid="REV 2:8">Nenga nga na Nnongoi na ywa Kuundi'la. Naatiwaa, no yu'ka! Mugapi'kani ganimmakia! <verse eid="REV 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 2:9" />Niitangite siki yinu na uki'ba winu, pamope no panga mwenga mwa matayili. Nigatangite matukano ga abo bababaya panga bembe Ayahudi, lakini Ayahudi ba kweli lili, ila bandu ba kipi'nga sa Ibilisi. <verse eid="REV 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 2:10" />Kanemuyogope ngu'su'mbu' yailu'a isa kwinu. Lingulyange! Ibilisi aalu'a kwayi'ya bi'ngi' binu muutabilwe li'nga mupayilwe, na mwenga mwapata ngu'su'mbu' masu'ba ku'mi. Lakini mube mwaaminika ata ikatei mpaka waa, nanenga nampeyanga taji ya ukoto wangayomoka.<verse eid="REV 2:10" /></para>
  <para style="pi">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 2:11" />Ywabile na makutu go yu'wa, na ayu'we galu' Loo agabakia makanisa. Ywasinda katu aasulikali na kiwo senebi'li'.<verse eid="REV 2:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Salamu kwa Pergamumu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 2:12" />“Kwa malaika wa kanisa lya Pergamumu wandike,</para>
  <para style="pi" vid="REV 2:12">Nenga nanibile na lipanga lyalitema ku'no na ku'no. Mugapi'kani ganimmakia! <verse eid="REV 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 2:13" />Nipatangite pamutama nga pakiti'gu' sa lenji sa Ibilisi! Lakini balo mulikamuliya lina lyangu'. Mwikanili imani yinu kwangu' nenga, ata masu'ba galu' ga Antipa, nkong'ondeli wangu' ywaaminika, paabulagilwe palu' pakitamo sa Ibilisi. <verse eid="REV 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 2:14" />Lakini nambi'yambi' nibile na makowe masene gangali yi'ki'tyana na mwenga. Akwo, mubile na bandu bababi'ngi'ya mayi'gano ga Balaamu. Balaamu annyi'ganiye Balaki li'nga Baisilaili bapange sambi kwo lya ilyo yaipiyilwe kwa inyago no panga upege. <verse eid="REV 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 2:15" />Nyinyonyo, mukipi'nga sinu kubile na bandu babakamwa mayi'gano ga Anikolai. <verse eid="REV 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="REV 2:16" />Bai, mugalambuki kwa Nnu'ngu'. Mana mukani galambuka, niisa kasinu kiyu'ngu'ya no ku'mbwana na bandu bo kwa lipanga lyalibu'ka munkano wangu'.<verse eid="REV 2:16" /></para>
  <para style="pi">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="REV 2:17" />Ywabile na makutu go yu'wa, na ayu'we galu' Loo agabakia makanisa. Ywaasinda nammetulya kilyo sa mana yayaaiyilwe. Kai', naapeya liwe lyu lyaliandikilwe lina lyayambi' panani yake. Ntu'pu' ywalu'a litanga lina li' ila yu'lu' ywalu'a peyelwa liwe lyo.<verse eid="REV 2:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Salamu kwa Tiatila</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="REV 2:18" />“Na kwa malaika wa kanisa lya Tiatila wandike,</para>
  <para style="pi" vid="REV 2:18">Nenga na Mwana wa Nnu'ngu', nanibile na minyo gagang'alang'atya kati malimi ga mwoto, magu'lu' gangu' kati kyu'ma sakimelemeteyilwe muno. Mugapi'kani ganimmakia! <verse eid="REV 2:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="REV 2:19" />Niitangite ili'be yoti yamupanga, upendo winu, imani yinu, utumisi winu no komeya kwinu. Kai', niibona panga, masu'ba gano mwendanogeya muno kulikoni palu' pamwatumbwile. <verse eid="REV 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="REV 2:20" />Lakini nibile na kikowe sangali yi'ki'tyana na mwenga. Mwenga muyi'ki'tyana na makowe ga nnwawa yu'lu' Yezebeli, ywaipanga nnondoli wa Nnu'ngu' lakini kumbe lili. Endayi'gana na kwaobeya atumisi bangu' bapange upege no lya ilyo yaipiyilwe kwa inyago. <verse eid="REV 2:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="REV 2:21" />Nimpei masu'ba go galambuka bu'ka mumasambi gake, lakini ywembe akani kuuleka upege wake. <verse eid="REV 2:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="REV 2:22" />Lingulya! Nilu'a kuntaikulya pakindanda kwa matamwe, ywembe pamope na boti babapangite nakwe upege. Bapala pata ngu'su'mbu' ngali' mana bakani galambuka kwa iyendo yabe akau. <verse eid="REV 2:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="REV 2:23" />Kai', nilu'a kwabulaga babankoleya, li'nga makanisa goti gatange panga nenga nganipekeseni myoyo na gabawasa bandu. Nanni'pa kila mundu bu'kana na iyendo yake.<verse eid="REV 2:23" /></para>
  <para style="pi">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="REV 2:24" />Lakini mwenga mwabi'ngi' mwamubile ku Tiatila mwamukotoka bi'ngi'ya mayi'gano ga Yezebeli, mwiyi'ganiyeli si'lu' sabakikema “Iyo ya Ibilisi,” nimmakianga panga nimpeyali kigombo si'ngi'. <verse eid="REV 2:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="REV 2:25" />Lakini mugakamuliye wiso makowe manogau gamubile nago, mpaka panaaisa.<verse eid="REV 2:25" /></para>
  <para style="pi">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="REV 2:26" />Ywaasinda no yendelya panga ganigapendi nenga mpaka kuundi'la, nampeya utawala wa mataipwa.<verse eid="REV 2:26" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="REV 2:27" />
    <char style="qt">Nembe aalu'a kwatawala kwa pimbo ya kyu'ma na kwakanjwana kati yombo ya utu'pi', </char></para>
  <para style="q" vid="REV 2:27">
    <char style="qt">kati nenga mwanipoki bu'ka kwa Tati' bangu'. </char><verse eid="REV 2:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="REV 2:28" />Nanenga nampeya lu'lu' lutondwa lwa kindai'. <verse eid="REV 2:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="REV 2:29" />Ywabile na makutu go yu'wa, na ayu'we galu' Loo agabakia makanisa.”<verse eid="REV 2:29" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="REV 3" />
  <para style="s">Salamu kwa Sarde</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 3:1" />“Kwa malaika wa kanisa lya Sarde wandike,</para>
  <para style="pi" vid="REV 3:1">Nenga nanikamwa loo saba ya Nnu'ngu' na ndondwa saba. Mugapi'kani ganimmakia! Niitangite ili'be yoti yamupanga. Ibayilwa panga mwenga mwabau'mi kumbe muwile. <verse eid="REV 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 3:2" />Muyumuke! Mube mwa bandu bo keleka, mugabi'ke wiso makowe gagaigalile gagaegelya waa. Kwa mwanjaa niibweni panga iyendo yinu munayomolelyali nnu'ngi' ya Nnu'ngu' wangu'. <verse eid="REV 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 3:3" />Bai, muku'mbu'ki galu' gamugapokile na kugapi'kaniya, mugayu'we na munki'li'bu'ki Nnu'ngu'. Muyumuke! Mana nyoli, niisa kasinu kiimuimu kati mwii, mwaatangali panaalu'a isa. <verse eid="REV 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 3:4" />Lakini kubile na aumini asene akwo Sarde, bembe banasapuyali magu'bo gabe kwo panga sambi. Bai, baalu'a tyanga pamope na nenga, nabembe baawalikilwa magu'bo mauu, kwa mwanjaa bandu bo babile na aki yo pangilwa nyo.<verse eid="REV 3:4" /></para>
  <para style="pi">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 3:5" />Ywaasinda, nang'walika ngu'bo uu kati bo. Naaliputali lina lyake mukitabu sa ukoto katu, kai' nannyi'ki'tya nnu'ngi' ya Tati' na malaika babe panga ayu' nga ywangu'. <verse eid="REV 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 3:6" />Ywabile na makutu go yu'wa, na ayu'we galu' Loo agabakia makanisa.<verse eid="REV 3:6" /></para>
  <para style="s">Salamu kwa Filadelfia</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 3:7" />“Kwa malaika wa kanisa lya Filadelfia, wandike,</para>
  <para style="pi" vid="REV 3:7">Nenga nanibile nampeleteu na ywa kakape, na nganibile na si'lu' kiyu'gu'lyo sa Daudi. Mana niyu'wile, ntu'pu' ywawesa yigala, mana niyigile, ntu'pu' mundu ywawesa yu'wa. Mugapi'kani ganimmakia! <verse eid="REV 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 3:8" />Niitangite ili'be yoti yamupanga! Lelo, niyu'wi nniango nnu'ngi' yinu, wembe ntu'pu' mundu ywawesa kuuyigala. Nitangite panga mwenga ntu'pu' makakala muno, lakini muwesite kuliyu'wa liyi'gi'yo lyangu' na mulikanili lina lyangu'. <verse eid="REV 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 3:9" />Lingulyange! Naaleta kwinu bandu ba kipi'nga sa Ibilisi, balu' bababaya panga bembe Ayahudi, lakini Ayahudi ba kweli lili, ila bendaku'pi'ya. Eloo, naaleta kwinu na kwapanga bakilikite nnu'ngi' yinu, li'nga bapate tanga panga nimpendi mwenga. <verse eid="REV 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 3:10" />Kwa mwanjaa mwikamwi amuli yangu' yo komeya, naalu'a kunni'ndi'la nsimu wa tabu yayaaisa padunia, nsimu wa mapayilwo ga kila ywatama padunia. <verse eid="REV 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 3:11" />Nisa kasinu kiyu'ngu'ya! Mukikamuliye samubile naso nambi'yambi', li'nga taji yinu yaakane pokonyolwa na mundu ywoywoti.<verse eid="REV 3:11" /></para>
  <para style="pi">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 3:12" />Ywaasinda, naalu'a kumpanga abe luyi'ma munyumba ya Nnu'ngu' wangu', aywo aapitali mo. Kai', naalu'a kumwandika lina lya Nnu'ngu' wangu' na lina lya kilambo sa Nnu'ngu' wangu' muyi'ga yake. Na kilambo so nga Yelusalemu yaayambi' yayaauluka bu'ka kunani kwa Nnu'ngu' wangu'. Kai', naalu'a kumwandika lina lyangu' lyayambi'.<verse eid="REV 3:12" /></para>
  <para style="pi">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 3:13" />Ywabile na makutu go yu'wa, na ayu'we galu' Loo agabakia makanisa.<verse eid="REV 3:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Salamu kwa Laodikia</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 3:14" />“Kwa malaika wa kanisa lya Laodikia wandike,</para>
  <para style="pi" vid="REV 3:14">Nenga nanibile Amina, nankong'ondeli ywau'bi'li'ka na ywa kweli, ywabile sokosoko ya yumbe yoti ya Nnu'ngu'. Mugapi'kani ganimmakia! <verse eid="REV 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 3:15" />Niitangite ili'be yoti yamupanga! Nitangite panga mwenga mubileli mwabaimu wala mwapyu'u. Ilu'e panga male mukabaa mwabaimu au mwapyu'u. <verse eid="REV 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="REV 3:16" />Bai, kwa mwanjaa ali yinu ya utombolou, kwenda ya upyu'u wala ya bwimu lili, nilu'a kumuuna kati mmata munkano. <verse eid="REV 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="REV 3:17" />Mwenga mwiibaya, “Twenga twa matayili, tupu'ngu'ki'lwali kikowe sosoti,” kumbe mutangiteli panga mwenga ali yinu ya pai' kai' ipalikwa mubi'ki'lwe kiya, mwaki'ba, mwakimbulibuli, na mutami watu'pu'. <verse eid="REV 3:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="REV 3:18" />Ninkong'ondelyanga mupi'me zaabu yaipeleteyilwe kwa mwoto bu'ka kwangu' nenga, li'nga mupate baa mwa matayili ba kweli. Kai', mupi'me magu'bo mauu, li'nga muwale no wi'ki'lya oni ya utu'pu' winu. Mupi'me na mauta mukapakale kuminyo yinu mupate lola. <verse eid="REV 3:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="REV 3:19" />Nenga nga ywakunkwi'li'ka na kumpwatya ywoywoti ywanimpenda. Kwa nnyo, mukasane na kunng'alambukya Nnu'ngu'. <verse eid="REV 3:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="REV 3:20" />Pi'kaniange! Nenga niyi'ma paniango no panga u'li. Mana mwaayu'wa lilobe lyangu' na kuuyu'wa nniango, naalu'a yingya mumayumba ginu no lya pamope namwenga, namwenga mwalya pamope na nenga. <figure style="fig" alt="Jesus knocking on the door - CN02107" file="JesusKnockingOnTheDoor_Rev3.20_CN02107.tif" size="col" copy="Illustrations by David C. Cook © David C. Cook Publishing Co., 1978." ref="3:20" /><verse eid="REV 3:20" /></para>
  <para style="pi">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="REV 3:21" />Ywaasinda, naalu'a kunnyi'ki'tya tama pamope na nenga panani ya kiti'gu' sangu' sa lenji, kati nenga namwene mwanisindike no tama pamope na Tati' bangu' panani ya kiti'gu' sabe sa lenji.<verse eid="REV 3:21" /></para>
  <para style="pi">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="REV 3:22" />Ywabile na makutu go yu'wa, na ayu'we galu' Loo agabakia makanisa.”<verse eid="REV 3:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="REV 4" />
  <para style="s1">Ibala ya kunani</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 4:1" />Bu'ka pa go, naatilingulya nganiubona nniango uyu'gu'lilwe kunani. Na li'lu' lilobe lyanaaliyu'wine palongoi lyaabile kati lipenga kalibaya, “Wise pano panani, li'nga nikulaye makowe gagapalikwa pitya nnu'ngi'.” <verse eid="REV 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 4:2" />Imukya, Loo Mpeleteu nganiulukya, nganikibona kiti'gu' sa lenji akwo kunani kitamilwe na mundu yumo. <verse eid="REV 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 4:3" />Aywo ywatami panani yake aabile nng'olou kati liwe likele lya samani. Kiti'gu' so saati'li'tilwe na lipi'tannu'ngu' lyaling'alang'atya muno. <verse eid="REV 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 4:4" />Kwaabile na iti'gu' yi'ngi' isilini nansese kaiti'li'ta kiti'gu' sa lenji, na panani ya iti'gu' yo baatami agoi isilini na nsese babaabile baweti magu'bo mauu na taji ya zaabu mumitwe. <verse eid="REV 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 4:5" />Kiti'gu' so sa lenji kipiyage njai na nnindimo. Nnu'ngi' yake paabile na imulikyo saba kaiyaka mwoto. Imulikyo yi' nga yi'lu' loo saba ya Nnu'ngu'. <verse eid="REV 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 4:6" />Nnu'ngi' ya kiti'gu' sa lenji, kwabile na kili'be kati baali ya kilolo. Baali yo yaabile kati liwe lyaling'alang'atya muno.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="REV 4:6">Mbwega ya kiti'gu' sa lenji paabile na yumbe nsese yene bwu'mi, yayaati'li'tike lwingo lwoti lwa kiti'gu' so, yayaabile na minyo kila pandu. <verse eid="REV 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 4:7" />Kyumbe kilongoi saalandine na imba, senebi'li' saalandine na ng'ombe nnu'me, senetatu saalandine na kuminyo ya mundu, na senensese saalandine na tai ywagu'lu'ka. <verse eid="REV 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 4:8" />Yumbe yo nsese yaabile na mapapayo sita, na kila pandu paabile na minyo. Yumbe yo yaabile kaiyi'mba pangali pu'mu'lya kilo na muntwekati. Mwambo wene waabile wu',</para>
  <para style="q" vid="REV 4:8">
    <char style="qt">“Mpeleteu, Mpeleteu, Mpeleteu, </char></para>
  <para style="q" vid="REV 4:8">
    <char style="qt">Bwana Nnu'ngu' Mwene Makakala Goti,</char></para>
  <para style="q" vid="REV 4:8">
    <char style="qt">aabile, ywabile, na ywaisa.” </char><verse eid="REV 4:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 4:9" />Yumbe yo, yendekunnumba, kumwisimu, na kunsukulu yu'lu' ywatami pakiti'gu' sa lenji na ywalama milele na milele, <verse eid="REV 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 4:10" />na balu' agoi isilini na nsese, baitu'yage pai' nnu'ngi' ya aywo ywatami pakiti'gu' sa lenji na kunkilikitya ayu' ywalama milele na milele. Nabembe bampikiage mataji gabe nnu'ngi' ya kiti'gu' sa lenji kababaya nnya,<verse eid="REV 4:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 4:11" />“Wenga wa Bwana na Nnu'ngu' witu aki yako</para>
  <para style="q" vid="REV 4:11">pokya utukupu na isima na makakala.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="REV 4:11">Kwa mwanjaa wenga waumbite ili'be yoti,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="REV 4:11">na kwo penda kwako yaumbilwe, na ibile.”<verse eid="REV 4:11" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="REV 5" />
  <para style="s1">Kitabu na Mwana ngondolo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <figure style="fig" alt="Scroll with 7 seals - GT00149" file="ScrollWith7Seals_Rev5.1_GT00149.jpg" size="col" copy="Illustrations by Gordon Thompson © Wycliffe Bible Translators Inc., 2012." ref="5:0" /> <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 5:1" />Bu'kapo nganikibona kitabu muluboko lwamalyo ga aywo ywatami panani ya kiti'gu' sa lenji, nasembe saandikilwe lwingo lwoti, no yigalilwa kwa miuli saba. <verse eid="REV 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 5:2" />Nganimmona kai' malaika mwene makakala kanwaya kwa lilobe liku'lu', “Nyai mwene aki yo ti'kwana ayo miuli na kukiumukwa kitabu so?” <verse eid="REV 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 5:3" />Lakini aapatikineli mundu ywoywoti kunani wala padunia, wala pai' kumambi', ywawesite kukiumukwa aso kitabu au kukilingulya nkati. <verse eid="REV 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 5:4" />Bai, nenga naatili'la muno kwa mwanjaa, aapatikineli mundu ywaabile na aki ya kukiumukwa au kukilingulya nkati. <verse eid="REV 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 5:5" />Lakini yumo ywa balu' agoi aatinibakia, “Kaneuli'le! Imba bu'ka mukabila ya Yuda, Mmelekwe wa lukolo lwa Daudi asindike na ngaywawesa ti'kwana miuli yake saba na kukiumukwa kitabu.”<verse eid="REV 5:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 5:6" />Bu'kapo nganimmona Mwana Ngondolo ayi'mi papipi na kiti'gu' sa lenji ati'li'tilwe na yumbe nsese yene bwu'mi na abo agoi. Mwana Ngondolo aabonekine kati atesinjilwa. Aabile na mbembe saba na minyo saba, ayo nga loo saba ya Nnu'ngu' yaitumilwe padunia yoti. <verse eid="REV 5:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 5:7" />Mwana Ngondolo ywo ngayenda na kukitola aso kitabu bu'ka muluboko lwa kummalyo lwa yu'lu' ywatami panani ya kiti'gu' sa lenji. <verse eid="REV 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 5:8" />Bu'ka pa Mwana Ngondolo kukitola si'lu' kitabu, yumbe nsese yene bwu'mi na agoi isilini na nsese baayinime nnu'ngi' ya Mwana Ngondolo. Boti baabile na kilimba, kai' baakamwi mabakuli ga zaabu gagatwi'li ubani, ago nga malu'bo ga bandu apeleteu ba Nnu'ngu'. <figure style="fig" alt="Musical instrument harp - BK00175" file="MusicalInstrument-Harp_BK00175.tif" size="col" copy="Illustrations by Horace Knowles revised by Louise Bass © The British &amp; Foreign Bible Society, 1994." ref="5:8" /> <verse eid="REV 5:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 5:9" />Nabembe baabile kabayi'mba mwambo wu'no wayambi' kababaya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="REV 5:9">“Wenga ubile na aki ya kukitola kitabu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="REV 5:9">na kwiti'kwana yundo ya miuli yake.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="REV 5:9">Kwa mwanjaa, wenga waatisinjilwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="REV 5:9">na kwa ndi'la ya myai yako, umpi'mi Nnu'ngu' witu</para>
  <para style="q" vid="REV 5:9">bandu bu'ka kila kabila, ba kila nnongelo, ba kila ngolo na kila taipwa.<verse eid="REV 5:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 5:10" />Wapei ukulungwa wa upi'ndo wa dini li'nga bantumikiye Nnu'ngu' witu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="REV 5:10">nabembe baatawala padunia.”<verse eid="REV 5:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 5:11" />Bu'kapo nganilinga, nganiyu'wa malobe ga malaika bambone bangaliwesa balangika, maelupu kwa maelupu, na maku'mi elupu mala maku'mi elupu, baatami kwo ti'li'ta kiti'gu' sa lenji pamope na yumbe yene bwu'mi na agoi isilini na nsese, <verse eid="REV 5:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 5:12" />kababaya kwa lilobe liku'lu',</para>
  <para style="q" vid="REV 5:12">“Mwana Ngondolo ywaasinjilwe, abile na aki yo pokya</para>
  <para style="q" vid="REV 5:12">uweso, utayili na ikima, makakala, isima, utukupu na sipwa!”<verse eid="REV 5:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 5:13" />Nganiyu'wa yumbe yoti kunani, padunia, pai' ya dunia na mubaali, yumbe yoti padunia kaibaya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="REV 5:13">“Kwake ywembe ywatama pakiti'gu' sa lenji,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="REV 5:13">na kwa Mwana Ngondolo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="REV 5:13">ibe sipwa na isima na utukupu na lenji,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="REV 5:13">milele na milele.”<verse eid="REV 5:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 5:14" />Na balu' yumbe nsese bau'mi baatibaya, “Amina!” Na balu' agoi baatu'i ukukama na kwakilikitya.<verse eid="REV 5:14" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="REV 6" />
  <para style="s">Mwana Ngondolo aiti'kwana miuli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 6:1" />Bu'kapo nganimmona Mwana Ngondolo kati'kwana yundo ya muuli waulongolile wa miuli yi'lu' saba. Nganiyu'wa lilobe lya yumo ywa balu' bau'mi nsese kalongela kati lilobe lya njai kabaya, “Mwise!” <verse eid="REV 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 6:2" />Panilingite naamweni falasi muu nnu'ngi' yangu'. Na ywamwu'bwike falasi ywo aabile na mpi'nde na aapeyilwe taji. Aamwimbiliye falasi yenda kunsinda ndumu li'nga apate usindi.<verse eid="REV 6:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 6:3" />Bu'kapo, Mwana Ngondolo ngati'kwana muuli wenebi'li'. Nganinnyu'wa yu'lu' kyumbe mwu'mi ywenebi'li' kabaya, “Wise!” <verse eid="REV 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 6:4" />Panilingite, nganimmona falasi ywi'ngi' ywa lukanda lukele kapitya. Ywamwu'bwike falasi yu' aapeyilwe makakala go bu'ya amani padunia li'nga bandu babulagane. Aapeyilwe lipanga liku'lu'.<verse eid="REV 6:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 6:5" />Mwana Ngondolo pauti'kwaniye muuli wenetatu, nannyu'wine kyumbe mwene bwu'mi ywenetatu kabaya, “Wise!” Panilingite, naamweni falasi mwene lukanda lupili nnu'ngi' yangu'. Ywamwu'bwike falasi yu' aabile na kili'ngo so li'ngya utopau muluboko lwake. <verse eid="REV 6:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 6:6" />Bu'ka pakatikati ya pabaabile balu' yumbe nsese, nganiyu'wa kili'be kati lilobe kakibaya, “Liposo lya kutwa yimo lyaapi'ma kilo simo bai sa bwembe wa ngano. Na liposo lya kutwa yimo lyaapi'ma kilo itatu bai ya bwembe wa shayiri<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6:6 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Shayiri nga kilyo sa bandu aki'ba.</char></note>. Lakini kanewalabiye mauta wala divai.”<verse eid="REV 6:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 6:7" />Bu'kapo, Mwana Ngondolo ngati'kwana muuli wenensese. Nganinnyu'wa yu'lu' kyumbe mwu'mi ywenensese kabaya, “Wise!” <verse eid="REV 6:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 6:8" />Nanenga nganilingulya na kumbe paabile na falasi na lukanda lwake lwa kiligu. Na lina lya ywamwu'bwike falasi ywo lyai Kiwo, na Kumambi' ammi'ngi'yage nsu'gu'. Abo baapeyilwe utawala bu'kana na lobo yimo ya dunia, baabulage bandu kwa lipanga, njala, tauni na kwa anyama akali' ba dunia.<verse eid="REV 6:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 6:9" />Bu'kapo, Mwana Ngondolo ngati'kwana muuli wa tano. Nganipabona palu' pai' ya kibi'ki'lyo, loo ya balu' bababulagilwe kwa kitumbu sa kuliu'bi'lya liyi'gi'yo lya Nnu'ngu', na ukong'ondeli wabe wabaaupiyite. <verse eid="REV 6:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 6:10" />Bai, baali'i kwa lilobe liku'lu', “We Bwana waubile wampeleteu na mwu'bi'li'ka, pakubawi pawaalu'a kwaukumu na kwabukiya babatama padunia kwa kitumbu so bulagilwa kwitu?” <verse eid="REV 6:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 6:11" />Kila yumo ngapeyelwa nganju ndaso yene lukanda luu, baabakiyilwe bayendeli lolela kwa masu'ba, mpaka payatimya isabu ya atumisi ayabe na alongo babaabulagilwa kati bembe mwabaabulagilwe.<verse eid="REV 6:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 6:12" />Bu'kapo nganimmona Mwana Ngondolo kauti'kwana muuli wa sita. Pauti'kwaniye bai, ngaupitya nnendemo nku'lu' padunia. Lisu'ba lyagalambwike lukanda, ngalibaa lipili kati makala, na mwei ngaubaa nkele kati myai. <verse eid="REV 6:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 6:13" />Ndondwa ngaitu'mbu'kya pai' padunia kati itunda yangali komala mwaitu'mbu'ka munkongo wake pautikilwa na nsunga. <verse eid="REV 6:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 6:14" />Kunani kumaunde ngakubu'yi'lwa kati likalatasi mwaliku'nji'lwa ku'nji'lwa, itu'mbi' na ndu'si' yoti paibile, yaatibu'yi'lwa. <verse eid="REV 6:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 6:15" />Bu'kapo, akulungwa ba padunia, agoi, alongosi ba ngondo, matayili, bene makakala, abanda na angwana, baayu'bite mumapango na mumipi'mbi' ya itu'mbi'. <verse eid="REV 6:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="REV 6:16" />Ngabaibakia ayo itu'mbi' na maliwe ga mpi'mbi', “Mututu'mbu'ki li'nga mutwiye kuutalu na ywembe ywatama panani ya kiti'gu' sa lenji, na kuutalu na nyongo ya Mwana Ngondolo! <verse eid="REV 6:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="REV 6:17" />Kwa mwanjaa, lisu'ba lyalibi'kilwe lya nyongo yabe litimile. Nyai ywaibi'i wiso yi'ma nnu'ngi' yake?”<verse eid="REV 6:17" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="REV 7" />
  <para style="s">Bi'ki'lwa muuli kwa bandu 144,000 ba Isilaili</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 7:1" />Bu'ka pa ago, nganaabona malaika nsese bayi'mi mulwingo lwoti lwa dunia, kabawibiliya nsunga kaneuyote ata pasene, munni'ma wala mubaali, wala mumikongo. <verse eid="REV 7:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 7:2" />Bu'kapo, nganimmona malaika ywi'ngi' kau'bu'kya kunani bu'ka kumbwani, abile na muuli bu'ka kwa Nnu'ngu' mwene ukoto. Ngau'bu'ya lilobe na kwabakia abo malaika nsese babakamukiyilwe lyengo lya kualabiya nni'ma na baali kabaya, <verse eid="REV 7:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 7:3" />“Kanemualabiye nni'ma, wala baali, wala mikongo, mpaka patwaayomwa kwabi'ka muuli pakibu'ngi' atumisi ba Nnu'ngu' witu.” <verse eid="REV 7:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 7:4" />Bu'kapo, nganiyu'wa isabu ya abo bababi'kilwe muuli, bandu 144,000 ba makabila goti ga bandu ba Isilaili. <verse eid="REV 7:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 7:5" />Bu'ka mukabila ya Yuda bandu 12,000, bu'ka mukabila ya Lubeni 12,000, bu'ka mukabila ya Gadi 12,000. <verse eid="REV 7:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 7:6" />Bu'ka mukabila ya Asheli 12,000, bu'ka mukabila ya Nafutali 12,000, bu'ka mukabila ya Manase 12,000. <verse eid="REV 7:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 7:7" />Bu'ka mukabila ya Simioni 12,000, bu'ka mukabila ya Lawi 12,000, bu'ka mukabila ya Isakali 12,000. <verse eid="REV 7:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 7:8" />Bu'ka mukabila ya Zebuluni 12,000, bu'ka mukabila ya Yosefu 12,000, na bu'ka mukabila ya Benyamini 12,000.<verse eid="REV 7:8" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kipi'nga sa bandu ba kila taipwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 7:9" />Bu'kapo nganilingulya, nganikibona kipi'nga kiku'lu' sa bandu bangaliwesa balangika, bandu ba kila nni'ma, kila kabila, ngolo na kila nnongelo. Nabembe baayi'mi nnu'ngi' ya kiti'gu' sa lenji na nnu'ngi' ya Mwana Ngondolo, baweti makanju mauu no kamwa ndambi' ya mitende mumaboko gabe. <verse eid="REV 7:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 7:10" />Ngabau'bu'ya lilobe kababaya, “Kosopolelwa kwitu kuuma kwa Nnu'ngu' witu ywatama panani ya kiti'gu' sa lenji, no bu'ka kwa Mwana Ngondolo!” <verse eid="REV 7:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 7:11" />Malaika boti ngabayi'ma kukiti'li'ta kiti'gu' sa lenji, agoi na balu' yumbe nsese bau'mi. Ngabatu'la pai' ukukama nnu'ngi' ya kiti'gu' sa lenji na kunkilikitya Nnu'ngu', <verse eid="REV 7:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 7:12" />kababaya, “Amina! Sipwa, utukupu, sukulu, isima, ikima, uweso na makakala gabe kwa Nnu'ngu' witu, milele na milele! Amina!”<verse eid="REV 7:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 7:13" />Yumo ywa balu' agoi nganilaluya, “Aba babaweti makanju mauu nga bandu gani? Na babu'ka kwaku'?” <verse eid="REV 7:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 7:14" />Nenga nganinnyangwa, “Wamwisimiwa, wenga utangite!” Nembe nganibakia, “Aba nga balu' babapite salama muyi'lu' siki ngu'lu'. Baagapulike makanju gabe mumyai ya Mwana Ngondolo, ngagapanga mauu muno. <verse eid="REV 7:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 7:15" />Nga kitumbu so baa nnu'ngi' ya kiti'gu' sa lenji sa Nnu'ngu'. Bantumikia Nnu'ngu' kilo na muntwekati munyumba yake, nembe ywatama panani ya kiti'gu' sa lenji alu'a kwali'ndi'la kwa mwanjaa, abile pamope nabo. <verse eid="REV 7:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="REV 7:16" />Baaminyali njala wala nnyota, lumu wala lyoto lyake lyaatiniyali kai', <verse eid="REV 7:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="REV 7:17" />kwa mwanjaa, Mwana Ngondolo ywabile pakatikati ya kiti'gu' sa lenji, aapanga nsungi wabe, nembe aalongoya kukinywanyu sa masi' ga ukoto. Nembe Nnu'ngu' aagaponwa moli goti gagabile muminyo gabe.”<verse eid="REV 7:17" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="REV 8" />
  <para style="s">Muuli wa saba</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 8:1" />Mwana Ngondolo pauti'kwaniye muuli wa saba, kunani ngakubaa liki kwa nusu ya lisaa limo. <verse eid="REV 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 8:2" />Bu'kapo, nganaabona malaika saba babayi'ma nnu'ngi' ya Nnu'ngu', baapeyilwe mapenga saba.<verse eid="REV 8:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 8:3" />Malaika ywi'ngi' aatiisa, ngatola aso kiteso sa zaabu no yi'ma nnu'ngi' ya kibi'ki'lyo so ukikiya ubani. Nembe ngapeyelwa ubani wambone li'nga aupiye salaka pamope na malu'bo ga bandu boti ba Nnu'ngu' panani ya kibi'ki'lyo sa zaabu yaibile nnu'ngi' ya kiti'gu' sa lenji. <verse eid="REV 8:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 8:4" />Lyoi lya ubani pamope na malu'bo ga apeleteu gau'bwike kunani nnu'ngi' ya Nnu'ngu' bu'ka mumaboko ga aywo malaika. <verse eid="REV 8:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 8:5" />Ngakitola aso kiteso na kukitwi'li'ya mwoto wa pakibi'ki'lyo na kukitaikulya padunia. Ngakubaa na njai, nnindimo, na nnendemo wa bwi'.</para>
  <para style="s" vid="REV 8:5">Mapenga</para>
  <para style="p" vid="REV 8:5">
    <figure style="fig" alt="Trumpeter facing R - GT00125b" file="TrumpeterFacingR_Rev9.1_GT00125b.jpg" size="col" copy="Illustrations by Gordon Thompson © Wycliffe Bible Translators Inc., 2012." ref="8:5" /> <verse eid="REV 8:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 8:6" />Balu' malaika saba babaabile na mapenga saba baaibi'i wiso yula mapenga gabe.<verse eid="REV 8:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 8:7" />Malaika nnongoi ngayula lipenga lyake. Nnyangabaniko wa ula wa maliwe na mwoto pamope na myai ngaiyitilwa panani ya nni'ma. Lumo kwa itatu ya nni'ma, mikongo na mabaliko gake ngaitinika.<verse eid="REV 8:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 8:8" />Bu'kapo, malaika ywenebi'li' ngayula lipenga lyake. Kili'be kati kitu'mbi' kiku'lu' sakiyaka mwoto saataikulilwe mubaali. Lumo kwa itatu ya baali ngaipanga myai, <verse eid="REV 8:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 8:9" />lumo kwa itatu ya yumbe ya mubaali ngaiwaa, na lumo kwa itatu ya meli ngaialabika.<verse eid="REV 8:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 8:10" />Bu'kapo, malaika ywenetatu ngayula lipenga lyake. Na lutondwa luku'lu' kaluyaka kati kyenge sa mwoto ngakitu'mbu'ka bu'ka kunani no tu'la panani ya lumo kwa itatu ya mabi'ndi' na inywanyu ya masi'. <verse eid="REV 8:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 8:11" />Na lina lya lu'lu' lutondwa lukemelwa “Lubabau.” Bai, lumo kwa itatu ya masi' ngagapanga mababau, bandu bambone ngabawaa bu'kana na masi' go, kwa mwanjaa gaagalambwike panga mababau.<verse eid="REV 8:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 8:12" />Bu'kapo malaika ywenensese ngayula lipenga lyake. Ngapo lumo kwa itatu ya lisu'ba, mwei na ya lutondwa ngaiku'mbu'lwa, kwa nyo ata bweya ngauobeya lumo kwa itatu yo ng'alang'atya kwake. Lumo kwa itatu ya muntwekati ngaikosa bweya, nyinyonyo na lumo kwa itatu ya kilo.<verse eid="REV 8:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 8:13" />Bu'kapo, nganilingulya nganinnyu'wa tai kagu'lu'ka kunani muno kabaya kwa lilobe liku'lu', “Baakibona, baakibona, baakibona balu' babatama padunia palu' malaika atatu babaigalile pabaalu'a yula mapenga gabe!”<verse eid="REV 8:13" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="REV 9" />
  <para style="s">Lipenga lya tano</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 9:1" />Na malaika wa tano payulike lipenga lyake, naalubweni lutondwa lwalutu'mbwike bu'ka kunani tu'mbu'kya padunia. Nalwembe ngalupeyelwa kiyu'gu'lyo sa lyi'mbwa lya kumambi'. <verse eid="REV 9:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 9:2" />Bu'kapo lu'lu' lutondwa ngaluyu'wa li'lu' lyi'mbwa lya kumambi' na lyoi ngalipita bu'ka mo kati lyoi lya litu'ta liku'lu'. Lisu'ba na kunani kwayi'yilwe lubi'ndu' na li'lu' lyoi lyalipitike mulyi'mbwa lyo. <verse eid="REV 9:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 9:3" />Mulyoi lyo ngabapita njige no elelya mudunia. Baapeyilwe uweso wo luma kati ipi'li'li'. <verse eid="REV 9:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 9:4" />Njige bo baamuliswe kanebaalabiye manyei wala maakapi wala mikongo yoyoti. Ila baasulu bandu balu' bangali baa na muuli wa Nnu'ngu' pakibu'ngi' sabe. <verse eid="REV 9:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 9:5" />Njige bo baayi'ki'tilweli kwabulaga bandu, ila baaku'su'mbwe kwa myei mitano. Maminyo gake gaai kati maminyo ga mundu ywalumilwe na kipi'li'li'. <verse eid="REV 9:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 9:6" />Masu'ba go bandu baalu'a kipala kiwo lakini baakipatali, baaminyikia waa lakini kiwo saalu'a kwatila.<verse eid="REV 9:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 9:7" />Njige bo baalandine na falasi babaabi'kilwe wiso kwa ngondo. Panani ya mitwe yabe baaweti kili'be sakibonekana kati taji ya zaabu na kuminyo yabe kwalandine na bandu. <verse eid="REV 9:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 9:8" />Baabile na nywili kati ya alwawa na mino gabe kati mino ga imba. <verse eid="REV 9:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 9:9" />Yuba yabe yawi'ki'lilwe na kiibiliyo sa kyu'ma. Malobe gagauma mumapapayo gabe gabile kati ga mimutuka yambone ya falasi yaibutukya kungondo. <verse eid="REV 9:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 9:10" />Baabile na miki'la yene mimimwa kati ipi'li'li', na uweso wa kwasulu bandu kwa myei mitano wabile mumiki'la yabe. <verse eid="REV 9:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 9:11" />Kai' baabile na nkulungwa naywembe nga malaika wa li'lu' lyi'mbwa lya kumambi', lina lyake kwa Kiebrania nga Abadoni na kwa Kiyunani nga Apolioni lombolya, “Ywalangamisa.”<verse eid="REV 9:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 9:12" />Malanganyiko malongoi gayomwike pi'ta no bu'kapo gi'ngi' gabi'li' galu'a ki'ngama.<verse eid="REV 9:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 9:13" />Malaika wa sita paaliyulike lipenga lyake, nganiyu'wa lilobe kalipita bu'ka mumbembe yaibile muitumembe nsese ya kibi'ki'lyo sa zaabu sasaabile nnu'ngi' ya Nnu'ngu'. <verse eid="REV 9:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 9:14" />Li'lu' lilobe ngalimmakia yu'lu' malaika wa sita ywaabile na lipenga panga, “Wayu'gu'li balu' malaika nsese babatabilwe mulibi'ndi' liku'lu' lya Flati.” <verse eid="REV 9:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 9:15" />Malaika bo nsese baabi'ki'lwe wiso kwa kitumbu sa saa yo, lisu'ba lyo, mwei wo, na mwaka wo. Baayu'gu'lilwe li'nga babulage lumo kwa itatu ya bandu ba padunia. <verse eid="REV 9:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="REV 9:16" />Naayu'wine panga mitumbi ya mayesi babau'bu'ka falasi yaai milioni mya ibi'li'. <verse eid="REV 9:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="REV 9:17" />Mumaloto gangu', naabweni falasi na au'bu'ka falasi babaabonekine baweti ibiliyo ya yu'ma muyuba yabe yayabile ya lukanda lukele, bulu, na ya manjano. Mitwe ya falasi yabonekine kati mitwe ya imba, mumikano ya falasi bo kwapitike mwoto, lyoi na bwaluti. <verse eid="REV 9:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="REV 9:18" />Lumo kwa itatu ya bandu ba padunia baabulagilwe kwa malanganyiko, yani mwoto, lyoi na bwaluti bu'ka mumikano ya falasi. <verse eid="REV 9:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="REV 9:19" />Makakala ga falasi bo gaai mumikano na mumiki'la yabe. Miki'la yabe yaai kati nng'ambo, na kwa mitwe ya nng'ambo yo baakombwi kwasulu bandu.<verse eid="REV 9:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="REV 9:20" />Bandu babakotwike bulagilwa mumalanganyiko go, baagalambwiyeli myoyo yabe na baakotwikeli kilikitya ili'be yaitengenesilwe kwa moko gabe. Baakilikiti moka, na inyago yaitengenesilwe kwa yu'ma ya samani, maliwe na mikongo, ili'be yaikotoka lola, yu'wa au tyanga. <verse eid="REV 9:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="REV 9:21" />Wala baagalambwili myoyo yabe kwa Nnu'ngu' no leka bulaga, bwabi', upege na bwii.<verse eid="REV 9:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="REV 10" />
  <para style="s">Malaika na kitabu kisene</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 10:1" />Bu'kapo nganimmona malaika ywi'ngi' mwene makakala kauluka bu'ka kunani. Aawalikilwe lyunde na lipi'tannu'ngu' panani ya ntwe wake, na kuminyo yake kwatimelemetya kati lisu'ba na magu'lu' gake gaabile kati mapi'pi'li' gagayakite mwoto. <verse eid="REV 10:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 10:2" />Mumoko gake aakamwi kitabu kisene sakiumukulilwe, ngalubi'ka lugu'lu' lwamalyo mubaali na lwanki'ya kuuyu'mu'. <verse eid="REV 10:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 10:3" />Aakemite kwa lilobe liku'lu' kati imba ywabunguluma, na pakemite, malobe ga njai saba ngagayangwa. <verse eid="REV 10:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 10:4" />Na ayo njai saba paiyangwile naapalike andika, lakini nganiliyu'wa lilobe bu'ka kunani kalinibakia panga, “Mayi'gi'yo ga njai yo saba, kaneuandike, ayo nga iyo.”<verse eid="REV 10:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 10:5" />Bu'ka pa go yu'lu' malaika ywanaamweni ayi'mi mubaali na kuuyu'mu' ngatu'ndu'bi'ya luboko lwamalyo kunani, <verse eid="REV 10:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 10:6" />ngalapa kwa lina lya Nnu'ngu' ywa lama milele na milele, Nnu'ngu' ywaumbite kunani na yoti yaibile mo, baali na yoti yaibile mo, dunia na yoti yaibile mo kabaya panga, “Nsimu wo li'nda uyomwike! <verse eid="REV 10:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 10:7" />Lakini nsimu wa malaika wa saba paalu'a liyula lipenga lyake, iyo ya Nnu'ngu' yalu'a timya kati mwaanwayite kwa atumisi bake alondoli.”<verse eid="REV 10:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 10:8" />Bu'kapo nganiliyu'wa lilobe kai' bu'ka kunani kalinibakia, “Uyende ukatole si'lu' kitabu sakiumukulilwe mumoko ga yu'lu' malaika ywayi'mi panani ya baali na kuuyu'mu'.” <verse eid="REV 10:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 10:9" />Bai, nganiyenda kwa yu'lu' malaika na kunnu'ba si'lu' kitabu, naywembe nganibakia, “Ukitole na ukilye, salu'a panga baba mundumbo yako, lakini munkano wako salu'a nong'omya kati busi.”<verse eid="REV 10:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 10:10" />Kwa nyo nganikitola si'lu' kitabu mumoko ga yu'lu' malaika na kukilya. Munkano wangu' saabile kinong'omyau kati busi, lakini panikimilike nndumbo yangu' sai kinammaba. <verse eid="REV 10:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 10:11" />Bu'kapo nganibayilwa panga, “Upalikwa piya ulondoli kai' bu'kana na makabila maingi, mataipwa maingi, ngolo yambone na akulungwa bambone.”<verse eid="REV 10:11" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="REV 11" />
  <para style="s">Akong'ondeli abi'li'</para>
  <para style="p">
    <figure style="fig" alt="Temple - WA04003" file="Temple_Rev11.1_WA04003.tif" size="col" copy="Illustrations by Graham Wade © United Bible Societies, 1989, Nairobi, Kenya." ref="11:0" /> <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 11:1" />Na apo, nganipeyelwa nnai wawaabile kati lutela lwo li'ngya, no bayilwa, “Uyende ukali'nge nyumba ya Nnu'ngu', pamope na kibi'ki'lyo, na kwabalanga bandu babakilikitya mo. <verse eid="REV 11:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 11:2" />Lakini kaneuli'nge luwa lwa panja ya nyumba ya Nnu'ngu', kwa mwanjaa apo baapeyilwe bandu bangali Ayahudi. Bembe baalu'a li'bata muyi mpeleteu wa Yelusalemu kwa myei alubaini nebi'li'. <verse eid="REV 11:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 11:3" />Na nenga naalu'a kwatuma akong'ondeli bangu' abi'li' bo piya ulondoli kwa masu'ba galu' elupu yimo mya ibi'li' na sitini baweti mabunia.”<verse eid="REV 11:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 11:4" />Abo akong'ondeli abi'li' nga mikongo ibi'li' ya minjaituni na inala ya imulikyo ibi'li' yaiyi'ma nnu'ngi' ya Nnu'ngu' ywatawala dunia yoti. <verse eid="REV 11:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 11:5" />Manaitei mundu kapaya kwasulu abo akong'ondeli, mwoto wapita mumikano yabe na kwalangamisa andumu babe. Na kwa ndi'la yo, nyinyonyo mundu ywalu'a paya kwasulu aalu'a bulagilwa. <verse eid="REV 11:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 11:6" />Akong'ondeli ba babile nawo uweso wo kanikia ula kaneanie munsimu wa ulondoli. Kai' babile nawo uweso wa galambuya masi' gapange myai no leta malangamiso ga kila sampuli mudunia kati mwabapendile.<verse eid="REV 11:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 11:7" />Bai, pabayomwa piya ulondoli wa Nnu'ngu', si'lu' kinyama sakibu'kite kumambi' salu'a ku'mbwana nabo na alu'a kwasinda na kwabulaga. <verse eid="REV 11:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 11:8" />Mitwi yabe yaigala musimbasimba ya muyi nku'lu', wu'lu' waabambilwe Bwana wabe. Muyi wo ubile na loo yailandana na Sodoma na Misili. <verse eid="REV 11:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 11:9" />Kwa masu'ba gatatu na nusu, bandu ba kila kabila, kila lukolo, kila nnongelo na kila taipwa baalu'a kwilola mitwi yabe na baayi'ki'ti'yali basikilwe. <verse eid="REV 11:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 11:10" />Bandu ba padunia baapulaikya kiwo sa abo alondoli abi'li' ba Nnu'ngu' kwo panga si'li'ku'si'li'ku' no peyana upo mbali'mbali', kwa mwanjaa alondoli baa baatikwaauya muno bandu ba padunia. <verse eid="REV 11:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 11:11" />Lakini bu'ka pamasu'ba gatatu na nusu mbu'mwo ya ukoti bu'ka kwa Nnu'ngu' ngayayingya nabembe ngabayi'ma, na boti babaabweni baatiyogopa muno. <verse eid="REV 11:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 11:12" />Apo balu' alondoli abi'li' ngabaliyu'wa lilobe bu'ka kunani kalyabakia, “Mwise ku'no kunani.” Nabembe ngabau'bu'ka kunani kumaunde ku'no andumu babe kabaalola. <verse eid="REV 11:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 11:13" />Saa yoyoyo ngakupita nnendemo nku'lu' wa bwi' na lumo kwa ku'mi ya muyi ngaitu'mbu'ka. Bandu elupu saba ngababulagilwa munnendemo wo, nabembe babaaigile ngabayogopa, ngabankwi'ya Nnu'ngu' wa kunani. <verse eid="REV 11:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 11:14" />Malanganyiko genebi'li' gayomwike pi'ta, na malanganyiko genetatu gendaki'ngama kiyu'ngu'ya.<verse eid="REV 11:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Lipenga lya saba</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 11:15" />Yu'lu' malaika wa saba ngayula lipenga lyake, ngakubaa na lilobe liku'lu' kunani kalibaya, “Ukulungwa wa dunia upangike ukulungwa wa Bwana witu na Kilisitu wake. Naywembe aatawala milele na milele.” <verse eid="REV 11:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="REV 11:16" />Nabembe balu' agoi isilini na nsese babatami nnu'ngi' ya Nnu'ngu' mwiiti'gu' yabe ya lenji ngabatu'la pai' wakukama na kunkilikitya Nnu'ngu', <verse eid="REV 11:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="REV 11:17" />kababaya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="REV 11:17">“Twendakusukulu wa Bwana Nnu'ngu' Mwene Makakala Goti,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="REV 11:17">waubile na wawaabile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="REV 11:17">kwa mwanjaa utumi makakala gako maku'lu' na nambi'yambi' wendatawala.<verse eid="REV 11:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="REV 11:18" />Bandu ba mataipwa baatiusika,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="REV 11:18">lakini nyongo yako isile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="REV 11:18">eloo, nsimu wa kwaukumu babawile.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="REV 11:18">Nga nsimu wa kwapeya upo atumisi bako alondoli,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="REV 11:18">apeleteu na boti babalikwi'ya lina lyako, agoi kwa anangu'ta.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="REV 11:18">Nga nsimu wa kwalangamisa babalangamisa dunia.”<verse eid="REV 11:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="REV 11:19" />Bu'kapo nyumba ya Nnu'ngu' yaibile kunani ngaiyu'gu'li'lwa, na lisanduku lya lilagano lyake ngalibonekana nkati yake. Na apo ngakupita bweya wa njai na nnindimo wake, ndu'ti, nnendemo wa nni'ma na ula nku'lu' wa maliwe.<verse eid="REV 11:19" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="REV 12" />
  <para style="s">Nnwawa na ling'ambo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <figure style="fig" alt="Woman and dragon - GT00152" file="Woman&amp;Dragon_Rev12.1,3_GT00152.jpg" size="col" copy="Illustrations by Gordon Thompson © Wycliffe Bible Translators Inc., 2012." ref="12:0" /> <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 12:1" />Bu'ka pa ago kwapitike mwasu nku'lu' kunani. Paabile na nnwawa ywaawalikilwe lisu'ba na mwei pai' ya magu'lu' gake, na pantwe wake paabile na taji ya ndondwa ku'mi nebi'li'. <verse eid="REV 12:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 12:2" />Na nnwawa ywo aabile ntopelwe, naywembe ngabu'bu'la kwa lilobe kwa kitumbu sa lwu'ngu' lwo papa.<verse eid="REV 12:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 12:3" />Kwapitike mwasu wi'ngi' akwo kunani, panga lyabonekine ling'ambo liku'lu' likele lyene mitwe saba, mbembe ku'mi na kila ntwe waabile na taji. <verse eid="REV 12:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 12:4" />Nki'la wa ling'ambo lyo wakumbike lumo kwa itatu ya ndondwa ya kunani na kwitaikulya mudunia. Nga li'lu' ling'ambo ngaliyi'ma nnu'ngi' ya yu'lu' nnwawa ywabile pipi no papa mwana li'nga aammile mwana ywo paabelekwa bai. <verse eid="REV 12:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 12:5" />Yu'lu' nnwawa ngapapa mwana nnalu'me, ywaalu'a gatawala mataipwa goti kwa pimbo yake ya kyu'ma. Lakini mwana ywo ngakosopolelwa no pelekelwa kwa Nnu'ngu' kukiti'gu' sake sa lenji. <verse eid="REV 12:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 12:6" />Aywo nnwawa ngabutukya kulupu'ngu'ti' kwaabi'kilwe wiso na Nnu'ngu' li'nga akotelwe kwa masu'ba elupu yimo na mya ibi'li' na sitini.<verse eid="REV 12:6" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mikaeli ang'wesite ling'ambo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 12:7" />Bai, ngakubaa na ngondo akwo kunani, Mikaeli na malaika bake ngabaku'mbwana na ling'ambo, na alyo ling'ambo na malaika bake ngabaku'mbwana nabo. <verse eid="REV 12:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 12:8" />Lakini li'lu' ling'ambo na malaika bake baatisindwa no obeya lipala lyabe akwo kunani. <verse eid="REV 12:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 12:9" />Li'lu' ling'ambo liku'lu' lyalyaataikulilwe pai', lyaatami bu'ka kwai'mbu', lyaakemilwe Ibilisi au Setani ywaikonga dunia yoti, pamope na malaika bake.<verse eid="REV 12:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 12:10" />Bu'kapo nganiliyu'wa lilobe liku'lu' kunani kalibaya, “Nambi'yambi' ukosopoli na uweso na ukulungwa wa Nnu'ngu' witu wisile na utawala wa Kilisitu wake. Kwa mwanjaa, ataikulilwe pai' nsitakili wa alongo bitu, ywasitakya nnu'ngi' ya Nnu'ngu' kilo na muntwekati. <verse eid="REV 12:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 12:11" />Alongo bitu bansindike kwa makakala ga myai ya Mwana Ngondolo na kwa mayi'gi'yo ga Nnu'ngu' gabaabakiye bandu. Nabembe kiwo pasaegelile, baayogwipeli waa. <verse eid="REV 12:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 12:12" />Kwa nyo mupulaikange mwenga mwa kunani, na mwaboti mwamutama mo. Lakini mwakibona mwamutama mudunia na mubaali, kwa mwanjaa yu'lu' Ibilisi ataikulilwe pai' na intwi'li nyongo, kwa mwanjaa atangite panga, nsimu wake wigali nsini bai.”<verse eid="REV 12:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 12:13" />Bai, li'lu' ling'ambo palikwipwile panga litaikulilwe pai' mudunia, ngalimpelemba yu'lu' mau' ywaapapike mwana nnalu'me. <verse eid="REV 12:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 12:14" />Apo yu'lu' nnwawa aapeyilwe mapapayo gabi'li' ga tai nku'lu'. Agu'lu'ki kuutalu na palibile li'lu' ling'ambo, pandu papu'ngu'ti' papaabi'kilwe wiso kwa ywembe. Akwo akotelwe kwa myaka itatu na nusu. <verse eid="REV 12:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 12:15" />Bu'kapo li'lu' ling'ambo ngalipiya masi' maingi munkano wake kati masi' ga mulibi'ndi', kagabutukya kwa yu'lu' nnwawa li'nga gakampu'twe. <verse eid="REV 12:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="REV 12:16" />Lakini bwi' ngaunkombwa yu'lu' nnwawa, ngauumukuka kati nkano na kugamila galu' masi' gagabu'ka kwa li'lu' ling'ambo. <verse eid="REV 12:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="REV 12:17" />Bai, ling'ambo lyo lyatikunkasilikya nnwawa ywo, ngaliibu'kya no yenda ku'mbwana na lubelekwo lwi'ngi' lwa nnwawa ywo, yani balu' babannyu'wa Nnu'ngu' na kunkong'ondelya Yesu. <verse eid="REV 12:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="REV 12:18" />Bai ling'ambo lyo ngaliyi'ma mbwega ya baali.<verse eid="REV 12:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="REV 13" />
  <para style="s">Inyama ibi'li'</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 13:1" />Bu'kapo naakibweni kinyama kiku'lu' sene mbembe ku'mi na mitwe saba kakipita mubaali. Na kila lupembe lwaabile na taji, na kila ntwe wabile uandikilwe lina lya kunkupulu Nnu'ngu'. <verse eid="REV 13:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 13:2" />Kinyama so sanaakibweni salandine na u'bi' na magu'lu' gake gaabile kati ga dubu<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">13:2 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Dubu nga kinyama nku'lu' mwene mayu'bo malaso na manyoya.</char></note>, nkano wake waabile kati nkano wa imba. Li'lu' ling'ambo lyampei aywo kinyama makakala gake, kiti'gu' sake sa lenji na utawala nku'lu'. <verse eid="REV 13:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 13:3" />Ntwe gumo wa kinyama ywo wabonekine kati upotekilwe muno, lakini libanga lyo liku'lu' lyaponi. Bandu boti ba padunia baatisangala na kunki'ngama ywembe. <verse eid="REV 13:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 13:4" />Nabembe ngabatumbwa kulikilikitya li'lu' ling'ambo kwa mwanjaa lyampei uweso wake yu'lu' kinyama. Kai' baankilikiti yu'lu' kinyama kababaya, “Nyai ywalandana na kinyama yu'? Nyai ywakombwa ku'mbwana ngondo nakwe?”<verse eid="REV 13:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 13:5" />Bu'kapo aywo kinyama aayi'ki'tilwe longela makowe ga salau na ga kupulu, no tumya utawala wake kwa myei alubaini nebi'li'. <verse eid="REV 13:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 13:6" />Kinyama ywo nku'lu' ngatumbwa kumpwi'wa Nnu'ngu', kulipwi'wa lina lyake, potamo wake na boti babatama kwo kunani. <verse eid="REV 13:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 13:7" />Aayi'ki'tilwe ku'mbwana ngondo na apeleteu ba Nnu'ngu' no sinda. Ngapeyelwa utawala kwa bandu ba kila kabila, kila lukolo, kila nnongelo na kila taipwa. <verse eid="REV 13:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 13:8" />Na bandu boti babatama mudunia baankilikitya kinyama ywo, ila balu' bai bene maina gagaandikilwe bu'ka kwai'mbu' mukitabu sa ukoti sa Mwana Ngondolo ywasinjilwe.<verse eid="REV 13:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 13:9" />Mwene makutu na agayu'we makowe ga.<verse eid="REV 13:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 13:10" />Mundu ywabinilwe panga ntabilwe, aatabilwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="REV 13:10">na ywabinilwe bulagilwa kwa lipanga, aabulagilwa kwa lipanga.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="REV 13:10">Kwa nyo bandu ba Nnu'ngu' bapalikwa komeya no baa na imani.<verse eid="REV 13:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 13:11" />Bu'kapo nganimmona kinyama ywi'ngi' kau'bu'ka bu'ka pai' mudunia. Aabile na mbembe ibi'li' kati ya mwana ngondolo, lakini aalongei kati ling'ambo. <verse eid="REV 13:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 13:12" />Kinyama ywo aatumi utawala wu'wu'lu'wu'lu' wa kinyama nnongoi kwa kitumbu sake. Autumi utawala wo li'nga kumpanga kila mundu ywatama mudunia ankilikiti kinyama ywo nnongoi, nga yu'lu' mwene libanga lya kiwo lyaliponi. <verse eid="REV 13:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 13:13" />Yu'no kinyama ywenebi'li' aapangite mangelongelo maku'lu', ata kuupanga mwoto ueli bu'ka kunani isa mudunia bandu kabalola mpu'la. <verse eid="REV 13:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 13:14" />Kinyama yu'no ywenebi'li' aakongite bandu babatama padunia kwo tumya mangelongelo gaapeyilwe uweso wa kugapanga kwa kitumbu sa kinyama nnongoi. Aamulise bandu tengenesa kinyago li'nga kumwisimu kinyama nnongoi, ywaapotekilwe kwa lipanga lakini aayendeli lama. <verse eid="REV 13:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 13:15" />Kinyama ywenebi'li' aapeyilwe uweso wa kukipeya mbu'mwo ya ukoti kinyago sa kinyama nnongoi. Bu'kapo kinyago sawesite longela na kwaamulisa bandu boti babaakotoka kukikilikitya kinyago so babulagilwe. <verse eid="REV 13:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="REV 13:16" />Kinyama ywenebi'li' nga ywaamulise bandu boti, agoi kwa anangu'ta, matayili kwa aki'ba, angwana kwa abanda, babi'ki'lwe alama panani ya maboko gabe gammalyo au muibu'ngi' yabe. <verse eid="REV 13:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="REV 13:17" />Aakanikiye kwa mundu ywoywoti pi'ma wala pi'mi'ya ila kwa balu' bababi'kilwe alama yo, yani lina lya aywo kinyama au isabu yaiyi'ma paali pa lina lyo.<verse eid="REV 13:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="REV 13:18" />Likowe li' lipalikwa ikima, ywoywoti ywabile na malango awesa balanga isabu ya aywo kinyama kwa mwanjaa, isabu yo ya mundu nsi'si'. Nayembe nga mya sita sitini na sita.<verse eid="REV 13:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 13" />
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="REV 14" />
  <para style="s">Mwambo wa bandu babakombolilwe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 14:1" />Bu'kapo nganimmona Mwana Ngondolo ayi'mi pakitu'mbi' sa Sayuni. Pamope nakwe baabile bandu mya yimo alubaini na nsese elupu bababile na lina lya Mwana Ngondolo na lina lya Tati' bake liandikilwe muibu'ngi' yabe. <verse eid="REV 14:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 14:2" />Nganiliyu'wa lilobe kalibu'ka kunani kati mwagayota masi' gambone gagabutuka na mwago kati wa njai. Lilobe lyanaliyu'wine lyai kati ndu'ti ya bandu babaoneya ilimba. <verse eid="REV 14:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 14:3" />Bandu bayi'mbage mwambo wayambi' nnu'ngi' ya kiti'gu' sa lenji na nnu'ngi' ya balu' yumbe nsese bene ukoti na balu' agoi. Ntu'pu' mundu ywaakombwi kwiyi'gana mwambo wo ila balu' mya yimo alubaini na nsese elupu bai, babaakosopolilwe bu'ka mudunia. <verse eid="REV 14:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 14:4" />Bandu bo nga balu' bangali kwisapuya kwa alwawa, na bembe nga kati igoli. Abo bammi'ngi'ya Mwana Ngondolo kwokwoti kwayenda. Bakombolilwe bu'ka nkati ya bandu bi'ngi', no pangilwa mili'mbu' kwa Nnu'ngu' na kwa Mwana Ngondolo. <verse eid="REV 14:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 14:5" />Bembe baalongeili ubu'su'bu'su' wala baabileli na lukoolo.<verse eid="REV 14:5" /></para>
  <para style="s">Malaika atatu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 14:6" />Bu'kapo naamweni malaika ywi'ngi' kagu'lu'ka kunani abile na Abali Inannoga ya milele ya Nnu'ngu' yo nwaya kwa balu' babatama mudunia, yani kwa bandu ba kila taipwa, kila kabila, kila nnongelo na kila lukolo. <verse eid="REV 14:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 14:7" />Malaika ngalongela kwa lilobe liku'lu', “Munkwi'ye Nnu'ngu' na munnumbe ywembe kwa mwanjaa saa ya Nnu'ngu' ya kwaukumu bandu yikite. Munkilikiti Nnu'ngu' ywaumbite kunani, dunia, baali na inywanyu ya masi'.”<verse eid="REV 14:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 14:8" />Malaika ywenebi'li' ngaanki'ngama yu'lu' nnongoi kabaya “utu'mbwike! Muyi nku'lu' wa Babeli utu'mbwike! Wanyweliye mataipwa goti divai yake yaibabite, kawalobeya na malau ga upege wake.”<verse eid="REV 14:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 14:9" />Malaika ywenetatu ngaaki'ngama balu' abi'li' alongoi kabaya, “Manaitei mundu ywoywoti kankilikitya ywo kinyama na kinyago sake no bi'ki'lwa alama pakibu'ngi' sake au muluboko lwake, <verse eid="REV 14:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 14:10" />baalu'a nywa divai ya nyongo ya Nnu'ngu'. Divai yo itengenesilwe kwa makakala gake goti mukikombe sa nyongo ya Nnu'ngu'. Mundu ywo alu'a teselwa mumwoto wa bwaluti nnu'ngi' ya malaika apeleteu na nnu'ngi' ya Mwana Ngondolo. <verse eid="REV 14:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 14:11" />Lyoi lya mwoto lyalibu'kana no tiniyilwa kwabe liu'bu'ka kunani milele na milele. Kwa bandu balu' babaankilikiti yu'lu' kinyama na kinyago sake no bi'ki'lwa alama ya lina lyake, baapu'mu'lyali kilo na muntwekati.”<verse eid="REV 14:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 14:12" />Kwa nyo bandu ba Nnu'ngu' babaikoleya amuli yake na kumwu'bi'lya Yesu, bapalikwa baa na ukomeyi.<verse eid="REV 14:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 14:13" />Bu'kapo nganiliyu'wa lilobe bu'ka kunani kalibaya, “Wandike! Nantali yabe bandu balu' tangu' nambi'yambi' babawaa balu'mbine na Bwana.” Loo Mpeleteu abaya panga, “Eloo ayo kakape. Baalu'a pu'mu'lya bu'kana na lyengo linannonopa kwa mwanjaa baalu'a pata upo bu'kana na mengo gabe ganannoga.”</para>
  <para style="s" vid="REV 14:13">Mauno ga dunia</para>
  <para style="p" vid="REV 14:13">
    <figure style="fig" alt="Sickle - CN02109" file="Sickle_CN02109.tif" size="col" copy="Illustrations by David C. Cook © David C. Cook Publishing Co., 1978." ref="14:13" /> <verse eid="REV 14:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 14:14" />Nganilola nnu'ngi' yangu' na nganilibona lyunde lyu na panani yake paabonekine yumo ywaabile kati Mwana wa Mundu ywaaweti taji ya zaabu muntwe wake na mbopo inantema muluboko lwake. <verse eid="REV 14:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 14:15" />Bu'kapo malaika ywi'ngi' ngaisa bu'ka munyumba ya Nnu'ngu' na kunkema kwa lilobe liku'lu' yu'lu' ywaatami panani ya lyunde kabaya, “Utole mbopo yako ukaune mwanjaa nsimu wo una wikite na mauno ga dunia gakomile.” <verse eid="REV 14:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="REV 14:16" />Kwa nyo yu'lu' ywaatami panani ya lyunde ngapi'ti'ya mbopo yake mudunia, na dunia ngaiunilwa. <verse eid="REV 14:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="REV 14:17" />Bu'kapo ngapita malaika ywi'ngi' munyumba ya Nnu'ngu' ya kunani abile na mbopo inantema.<verse eid="REV 14:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="REV 14:18" />Bu'kapo malaika ywi'ngi' ywaabile ntawala wa mwoto ngapita mukibi'ki'lyo naywembe ngaankema yu'lu' malaika mwene mbopo inantema kwa lilobe liku'lu' kabaya, “Utole mbopo yako inantema, ukateme ande ya minjabibu ya dunia, kwa mwanjaa itunda ikomile.” <verse eid="REV 14:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="REV 14:19" />Bai, malaika ywo ngapi'ti'ya mbopo yake mudunia no una njabibu ya dunia na kwiyi'ya nkati ya sombo kiku'lu' so komangya njabibu sene nyongo ya Nnu'ngu'. <verse eid="REV 14:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="REV 14:20" />Njabibu yakomangilwe panja ya muyi, myai yatibutuka bu'ka mukikomangilyo mpaka ika ulaso wa kilometa mya itatu. No yendekeya kwa myai yo kwaabile meta yimo na nusu.<verse eid="REV 14:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 14" />
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="REV 15" />
  <para style="s">Malanganyiko maku'lu' ga kuundi'la</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 15:1" />Bu'kapo nganiubona mwasu wi'ngi' nku'lu' wa ayabu na wausangalilwa muno kunani. Apo paabile na malaika saba bene malanganyiko saba ga kuundi'la, kwa malanganyiko go saba, nyongo ya Nnu'ngu' ngaitimya.<verse eid="REV 15:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 15:2" />Nganikibona kili'be kati baali ya kilolo yaiyangabanike na mwoto, mbwega ya baali yo baabile bandu bayi'mi balu' babansindike yu'lu' kinyama na kinyago sake pamope na isabu ya lina lyake. Mumaboko gabe baakamwi ilimba yabaapeyilwe na Nnu'ngu'. <verse eid="REV 15:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 15:3" />Baabile kabayi'mba mwambo wa Musa, ntumisi wa Nnu'ngu' na wa Mwana Ngondolo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="REV 15:3">“Bwana Nnu'ngu' Mwene Makakala Goti,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="REV 15:3">iyendo yako ngu'lu' na ya ayabu muno!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="REV 15:3">Wa nkulungwa wa mataipwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="REV 15:3">mali'la gako nga ga aki na kakape!<verse eid="REV 15:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 15:4" />Bwana nga nyai ywakotoka kukuisimu wenga?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="REV 15:4">Nyai ywakotoka kulikwi'ya lina lyako?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="REV 15:4">Wenga kisako nga wa mpeleteu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="REV 15:4">Mataipwa goti gaakuisilya na kukukilikitya</para>
  <para style="q" vid="REV 15:4">mwanjaa iyendo yako ya aki itanganikwe.”<verse eid="REV 15:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 15:5" />Bu'ka pa go nganiibona nyumba ya Nnu'ngu' iyu'gu'lilwe kunani, yani ema yailaya baa kwa Nnu'ngu'. <verse eid="REV 15:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 15:6" />Bai, balu' malaika saba bene malanganyiko saba ngabapita mo baweti ngu'bo ya kitani sapi inammelemetya na nkanda wa zaabu muyuba yabe. <verse eid="REV 15:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 15:7" />Bu'kapo yumo ywa balu' yumbe nsese yene ukoti ngaapeya malaika mabakuli saba ga zaabu gagatwi'li nyongo ya Nnu'ngu' ywalama milele na milele. <verse eid="REV 15:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 15:8" />Nyumba ya Nnu'ngu' yaatwi'li lyoi lyalibu'kana na utukupu na makakala ga Nnu'ngu'. Ntu'pu' ywakombwa yingya munyumba yo ya Nnu'ngu' mpaka palu' malanganyiko saba ga malaika saba pagayomokile.<verse eid="REV 15:8" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 15" />
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="REV 16" />
  <para style="s">Mabakuli ga nyongo ya Nnu'ngu'</para>
  <para style="p">
    <figure style="fig" alt="Pouring Bowl - GT00153" file="PouringBowl_Rev16_GT00153.jpg" size="col" copy="Illustrations by Gordon Thompson © Wycliffe Bible Translators Inc., 2012." ref="16:0" /> <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 16:1" />Bu'kapo nganiyu'wa lilobe liku'lu' bu'ka munyumba ya Nnu'ngu', kalyaabakia balu' malaika saba, “Muyende mukayakanikiye mudunia ago mabakuli saba ga nyongo ya Nnu'ngu'.”<verse eid="REV 16:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 16:2" />Malaika nnongoi, ngayenda yakanikia bakuli yake panani ya nni'ma. Apo balu' boti bababi'kilwe alama ya yu'lu' kinyama na babakilikityage inyago yake ngabapata yu'ngu'pu'te yaiminya muno.<verse eid="REV 16:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 16:3" />Na aywo ywenebi'li', ngayakanikia bakuli yake mubaali, nayembe ngaigalambuka panga kati myai ya mundu ywawile na kila sampuli ya kyumbe sasaabile mubaali ngakiwaa.<verse eid="REV 16:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 16:4" />Malaika ywenetatu ngayakanikia bakuli yake mumabi'ndi' na muinywanyu ya masi', nayembe ngaigalambuka panga myai. <verse eid="REV 16:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 16:5" />Apo nganinnyu'wa malaika nnyi'mi'li'ki ywa masi' kabaya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="REV 16:5">“Wenga wampeleteu, waubile na wawaabile!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="REV 16:5">Wenga upangite aki kugaukumu makowe ga.<verse eid="REV 16:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 16:6" />Mwanjaa, baayitaniye myai ya apeleteu na ya alondoli bako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="REV 16:6">na wenga wapei myai banywe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="REV 16:6">kati mwabapalikwage.”<verse eid="REV 16:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 16:7" />Bu'kapo nganiyu'wa lilobe pakibi'ki'lyo kalibaya, “Eloo, wa Bwana Nnu'ngu' Mwene Makakala Goti! Ukumu yako nga ya kweli na ya aki!”<verse eid="REV 16:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 16:8" />Bu'kapo malaika ywenensese, ngayakanikia bakuli yake panani ya lisu'ba. Lisu'ba ngalipata makakala ga kwatiniya bandu kwa mwoto wake. <verse eid="REV 16:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 16:9" />Bai bandu ngalwabalya muno lumu, nabembe ngabalipwi'wa lina lya Nnu'ngu' ywabile na uweso bu'kana na malanganyiko go. Lakini baagalambwikeli wala bankwi'yiteli Nnu'ngu'.<verse eid="REV 16:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 16:10" />Na aywo malaika ywatano ngayakanikia bakuli yake panani ya kiti'gu' sa lenji sa yu'lu' kinyama nku'lu', popopo ukulungwa wake ngauwi'ki'li'lwa na lubi'ndu'. Bandu ngabatauna ndimi yabe bu'kana no minya, <verse eid="REV 16:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 16:11" />ngabampwi'wa Nnu'ngu' ywa kunani kwo bu'kana no minya kwabe na mabanga gabe, lakini baagalambwikeli bu'ka muiyendo yabe ndau.<verse eid="REV 16:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 16:12" />Malaika wa sita ngayakanikia bakuli yake mulibi'ndi' liku'lu' lyalikemelwa Flati, masi' gake ngagayuma li'nga bi'ka wiso ndi'la kwa kitumbu sa akulungwa bababu'ka kumbwani. <verse eid="REV 16:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 16:13" />Bu'kapo nganiibona loo ya masetani atatu, babalandana na yulaa kabapita munkano wa li'lu' ling'ambo na munkano wa yu'lu' kinyama na munkano wa yu'lu' nnondoli wa ubu'su'. <verse eid="REV 16:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 16:14" />Ayo nga loo ya masetani yaipanga mangelongelo, nayembe ngayayendelya akulungwa boti ba dunia na kwakongolya pamope kwa kitumbu sa ngondo mulisu'ba li'lu' liku'lu' lya Nnu'ngu' Mwene Makakala Goti.<verse eid="REV 16:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 16:15" />Bwana Yesu endabaya, “Mupi'kani, naalu'a isa kati na mwii. Nantali mundu yu'lu' ywatama minyo no wala ngu'bo yake li'nga aakane yenda watu'pu' no pata oni.”<verse eid="REV 16:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="REV 16:16" />Bai, masetani ngagakongolya pamope akulungwa boti na mayesi gabe pandu papakemelwa kwa Kiebrania, Armagedoni.<verse eid="REV 16:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="REV 16:17" />Malaika wa saba ngayakanikia bakuli yake kunani kumaunde, na lilobe liku'lu' ngalipitya mu'lu' mukiti'gu' sa lenji munyumba ya Nnu'ngu' kalibaya, “Iyomwike pangika!” <verse eid="REV 16:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="REV 16:18" />Ngakupitya njai, nnindimo na dunia ngailendema muno. Nnendemo wo waai nku'lu' pi'ta yoti yayaapitike bu'ka Nnu'ngu' pamuumbike mundu. <verse eid="REV 16:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="REV 16:19" />Awo muyi nku'lu' ngaubaganika mala itatu, na miyi ya mataipwa ngaialabika yoti. Na ywembe Nnu'ngu' aulibali lili wu'lu' muyi nku'lu' wa Babeli, aupei kikombe si'lu' sa divai ya nyongo yake ngu'lu'. <verse eid="REV 16:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="REV 16:20" />Nnendemo wo wapangite kitumbu so oba isiwa yoti na itu'mbi' yoti yaabonekineli kai'. <verse eid="REV 16:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="REV 16:21" />Ula wa maliwe ngania, maliwe go gaai maku'lu' gagaika kati kilo alubaini kwa kila liwe, ngaani'lya bandu. Na bembe ngabantukana Nnu'ngu' kwa kitumbu sa malanganyiko go, kwa mwanjaa gaabile malanganyiko maku'lu' muno.<verse eid="REV 16:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 16" />
  <chapter number="17" style="c" sid="REV 17" />
  <para style="s">Mpege nku'lu'</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 17:1" />Ngaisa yumo ywa balu' malaika saba babaakamwi ibakuli, ngaanibakia, “Wise ku'no, nilu'a kulaya ukumu ya yu'lu' mpege nku'lu' ywatama papipi na masi' maingi. <verse eid="REV 17:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 17:2" />Akulungwa ba dunia baapangite upege pamope nakwe, na bandu babatama padunia baalobile kwa divai ya upege wake.”<verse eid="REV 17:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 17:3" />Bu'kapo yu'lu' malaika nganipu'twa kwa Loo Mpeleteu, na kunipeleka mpaka kulupu'ngu'ti'. Akwo nganimmona nnwawa yumo atami panani ya kinyama nkele ywaabile na maina ga kunkupulu Nnu'ngu' kila pandu muyi'ga yake. Kinyama ywo aabile na mitwe saba na mbembe ku'mi. <verse eid="REV 17:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 17:4" />Nnwawa ywo aaweti ngu'bo ya lukanda lwa sambalau na lukele, kai' aainemike kwa zaabu, maliwe ga samani na lulu. Mumaboko gake aakamwi kikombe sa zaabu sasaatwi'li masukwo na ili'be njapu ya awo upege wake. <verse eid="REV 17:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 17:5" />Pakibu'ngi' sake paandikilwe lina lya iyo, “Babeli Nku'lu', Mau' ba apege na masukwo ga dunia.” <verse eid="REV 17:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 17:6" />Nganimmona nnwawa ywo alobile kwo nywa myai ya apeleteu ba Nnu'ngu' babaawile kwa kitumbu sa kunkong'ondelya Yesu.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="REV 17:6">Panimweni bai, naatisangala muno. <verse eid="REV 17:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 17:7" />Lakini malaika nganilaluya, “Mwanjaa namani usangala? Nilu'a kuawanikia iyo ya nnwawa ywo na aywo kinyama ywamwu'bwike, mwene mitwe saba na mbembe ku'mi. <verse eid="REV 17:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 17:8" />Aywo kinyama ywaumweni abile nkoti patumbu, lakini nambi'yambi' awile, na ywembe abile wiso u'bu'ka bu'ka kumambi' lakini ayenda langamiswa. Na abo babatama padunia bangali andikilwa maina gabe mukitabu sa ukoto bu'ka bi'ki'lwa misingi ya dunia, baalu'a sangala kummona aywo kinyama ywaai nkoto, bu'kapo waa, na nambi'yambi' endapitya kai'.<verse eid="REV 17:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 17:9" />“Pano papalikwa malango na ikima. Ayo mitwe saba nga itu'mbi' saba yaatami aywo nnwawa panani yake. <verse eid="REV 17:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 17:10" />Kai' ayo mitwe saba nga akulungwa saba. Baabile batano babayomwike tu'mbu'ka, ywi'ngi' ngaywatawala nambi'yambi', na abile ywi'ngi' ila anaisali, lakini paalu'a isa aapalikwa tama kwa masu'ba masene bai. <verse eid="REV 17:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 17:11" />Yu'lu' kinyama ywaabile nkoti lakini nambi'yambi' awile, nga nkulungwa wa nane, na ywembe kai' abile mukipi'nga sa abo saba, na ywembe ayenda langamiswa.<verse eid="REV 17:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 17:12" />“Yi'lu' mbembe ku'mi yawibweni nga akulungwa ku'mi bababile balo pokya ukulungwa, lakini baalu'a pokya utawala wo panga akulungwa kwa lisaa limo pamope na yu'lu' kinyama. <verse eid="REV 17:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 17:13" />Mabinio ga atawala aba boti ku'mi gamo, na bembe baalu'a kunnekya yu'lu' kinyama makakala na utawala wabe. <verse eid="REV 17:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 17:14" />Baalu'a ku'mbwana ngondo na Mwana Ngondolo, lakini Mwana Ngondolo aalu'a kwasinda kwa kitumbu sa ywembe nga Bwana wa mabwana na Nkulungwa wa akulungwa. Ywembe aalu'a baa na bandu bake baakemite, baasawile, na babau'bi'li'ka.”<verse eid="REV 17:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 17:15" />Bu'kapo aywo malaika nganibakia, “Galu' masi' gaugabweni yu'lu' mpege atami panani yake nga bandu baingi ba mataipwa, alongo na milongelo mbali'mbali'. <verse eid="REV 17:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="REV 17:16" />Yi'lu' mbembe ku'mi yawibweni na yu'lu' kinyama, baalu'a kunsukwa aywo mpege. Baalu'a tola kila kili'be na kunneka watu'pu', baalu'a tauna nnyama yake na kuntiniya kwa mwoto. <verse eid="REV 17:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="REV 17:17" />Kwa mwanjaa, Nnu'ngu' abi'i mumyoyo yabe timisa mabinio gake kwo yi'ki'tya kumpeya yu'lu' kinyama makakala gabe ga utawala, mpaka mayi'gi'yo ga Nnu'ngu' pagaatimya.<verse eid="REV 17:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="REV 17:18" />“Na yu'lu' nnwawa ywaumweni nga wu'lu' muyi nku'lu' waubile na utawala bu'kana na akulungwa ba dunia.”<verse eid="REV 17:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 17" />
  <chapter number="18" style="c" sid="REV 18" />
  <para style="s">Langamiswa kwa Babuloni</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 18:1" />Bu'ka pa ago nganimmona malaika ywi'ngi' kaelya bu'ka kunani, abile na utawala nku'lu' na dunia ngaimulikilwa na bweya wake. <verse eid="REV 18:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 18:2" />Bai, nganwaya kwa lilobe liku'lu' kabaya, “Utu'mbwike! Muyi nku'lu' wa Babeli utu'mbwike! Nambi'yambi' uyu'kite utamo wa masetani, kila sampuli ya moka maakau, iyuni njapu na inyama yaisukilwa na yaibile njapu. <verse eid="REV 18:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 18:3" />Utu'mbwike kwa mwanjaa bandu ba mataipwa goti baainywile divai yake, baalobile na maminyikio gake ga upege. Akulungwa ba dunia baapangite nakwe upege, na asulusi ba dunia baatayilike bu'kana na maminyikio gangali kili'ngo.”<verse eid="REV 18:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 18:4" />Bu'kapo nganiyu'wa lilobe li'ngi' bu'ka kunani kalibaya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="REV 18:4">“Mwabandu bangu' mubu'ke pakatikati yake,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="REV 18:4">li'nga kanemupange kiselele mumasambi gake,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="REV 18:4">mwaakane pata ukumu yake.<verse eid="REV 18:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 18:5" />Kwa mwanjaa, masambi gake gambone,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="REV 18:5">gaikite ata kunani</para>
  <para style="q" vid="REV 18:5">na Nnu'ngu' agalibalyali malau gake.<verse eid="REV 18:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 18:6" />Kati mwaapangi bi'ngi', na mwenga mumpangi nyinyonyo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="REV 18:6">kai' mumpangi pabi'li' yake.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="REV 18:6">Mukikombe sake sa divai munnyangabani na kinywo kinammaba pabi'li' yake ya si'lu' saapeile bi'ngi'.<verse eid="REV 18:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 18:7" />Mumpei ngu'su'mbu' na usuni yambone kati mwaikwi'yite kwo pata utayili wake. Kwa mwanjaa mumwoyo wake aipuna kwo baya, ‘Nenga niyi'ma kati malikia,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="REV 18:7">nenga na mau' nng'wi'li'kwa lili, na wala nausunikali!’<verse eid="REV 18:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 18:8" />Kwa nyo malanganyiko gake gaalu'a kumpata kwa lisu'ba limo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="REV 18:8">njala, usuni na kiwo.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="REV 18:8">Na ywembe aalu'a tiniyilwa mwoto,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="REV 18:8">Kwa mwanjaa Bwana Nnu'ngu' ywamukumu abile na uweso.”<verse eid="REV 18:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 18:9" />Akulungwa ba dunia babaapangite nakwe upege no panga nakwe kiselele muutayili wake, pabaalu'a libona lyoi lyo tinika kwake, baalu'a kunni'lya no lombola. <verse eid="REV 18:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 18:10" />Akulungwa bo baalu'a yi'ma kuutalu na muyi wo kwo yogopa ngu'su'mbu' yake, baalu'a li'la kababaya, “Baakibona! Baakibona ba muyi nku'lu' wa Babeli wene uweso! Kwa mwanjaa mulisaa limo bai, ukumu yako ikuisilile.”<verse eid="REV 18:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 18:11" />Na asulusi ba dunia baalu'a kunni'lya no lombola, kwa mwanjaa ntu'pu' bandu bo pi'ma ili'be yabe. <verse eid="REV 18:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 18:12" />Ntu'pu' mundu kai' ywo pi'ma ili'be ya zaabu, ya yu'ma ya samani, ya maliwe ga samani na ya lulu, kitani na ngu'bo ya lukanda lwa sambalau, alili na ngu'bo ngele, mbago ya samani, na yombo yaitengeneswile na mbembe ya ndembo, mikongo ya samani ngu'lu', shaba, kyu'ma na malumalu. <verse eid="REV 18:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 18:13" />Ntu'pu' mundu ywo pi'ma mdalasini, ndakyo, ubani, manemane, udi, divai, mauta, bwembe sapi na ngano, ng'ombe na ngondolo, falasi na mimutuka yo kwakwata, na abanda na ata maisa ga bandu. <verse eid="REV 18:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 18:14" />Babapanga nsuluso baalu'a baya panga, “Ili'be yayaabile kawiipenda muno iyomwike. Utayili wako woti na ugolou wako uyomwike, wala iwesekanikali pata kai'.” <verse eid="REV 18:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 18:15" />Balu' babaapangite usulusi wo no tayilika bu'kana na ywembe, baalu'a yi'ma kuutalu nakwe kwa bwoga nku'lu' wa ngu'su'mbu' yaimpata. Baalu'a li'la no lombola, <verse eid="REV 18:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="REV 18:16" />kababaya, “Waakibona! Waakibona, wa muyi nku'lu', wawaayobeli wala ngu'bo ya kitani, ya lukanda lwa sambalau na ngele, na kwinemeka kwa zaabu, maliwe ga bei ngu'lu' na lulu. <verse eid="REV 18:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="REV 18:17" />Nkati ya lisaa limo bai, utayili wambone kati wu', walabiyilwe!”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="REV 18:17">Bu'kapo ayendelesi ba ngalaba na boti bababile mumwanja wo, na apanga kasi ya mubaali, baayi'mi kuutalu, <verse eid="REV 18:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="REV 18:18" />ngabali'la muno pabalibweni lyoi lya mwoto wo tinika kwake, ngababaya, “Kunabaali muyi nku'lu' kati wu'?” <verse eid="REV 18:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="REV 18:19" />Ngabaiyitya ligu mumitwe yabe, ku'no kabali'la no lombola, kababaya, “Bakibona! Bakibona, mwamuyi nku'lu', muyi wautupangite twaboti twabene ngalaba tube twamatayili kwa kitumbu sa utayili wake. Lakini kwa lisaa limo bai waatilangamiswa.”<verse eid="REV 18:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="REV 18:20" />“Mupulaike mwenga mwa kunani, mwabandu ba Nnu'ngu', atumilwe pamope na alondoli bake, mupulaike kwa kitumbu sa makowe gagapitike mumuyi wu'lu', kwa mwanjaa Nnu'ngu' ampeile aki yinu kwa kwaukumu bembe.”<verse eid="REV 18:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="REV 18:21" />Bu'kapo malaika yumo mwene uweso ngatu'ndu'bi'ya liwe lyalilandana na liwe liku'lu' lyo yagya. Ngalitaikwa mubaali kabaya, “Amo ngamwawataikulwa muyi nku'lu' wa Babeli na wembe waalu'a bonekanali kai'. <verse eid="REV 18:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="REV 18:22" />Wala lilobe lya ayi'mbi na babaoneya inanda, pilimbi na lipenga yaalu'a yu'wanikali kai' kasako. Ntu'pu' nng'anga ywoywoti ywaalu'a patikana nkati yako, wala lilobe lya liwe lyo yagya lyalu'a yu'wanikali kai' nkati yako. <verse eid="REV 18:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="REV 18:23" />Bweya wa kimulikyo waabonekanali kai' nkati yako, wala waalu'a yu'wali lilobe lya si'li'ku'si'li'ku' ya ywakobeka wala ku'nda. Asulusi bako baabile bandu babatanganikwa muno padunia, na kwa bwabi' wako mataipwa goti gaatiobeyelwa.<verse eid="REV 18:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="REV 18:24" />“Muyi wo wapwatilwe kwa mwanjaa mo yaapatikine myai ya alondoli, na ya apeleteu na ya bandu boti bababulagilwe padunia.”<verse eid="REV 18:24" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 18" />
  <chapter number="19" style="c" sid="REV 19" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 19:1" />Bu'ka pa ago nganiyu'wa lilobe kati lya kipi'nga kiku'lu' kunani, kabayoba kwa lilobe liku'lu' kababaya, “Alumbilwe Nnu'ngu'! Ukosopoli, utukupu na uweso nga wa Nnu'ngu' witu, <verse eid="REV 19:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 19:2" />kwa mwanjaa ukumu yake nga ya kweli na aki. Ampei ukumu yu'lu' mpege nku'lu' ywaaikongite dunia kwa upege wake. Nnu'ngu' aatikummukiya kwa kitumbu sa myai ya atumisi bake!” <verse eid="REV 19:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 19:3" />Ngababaya kai', “Alumbilwe Nnu'ngu'! Lyoi lyake awo muyi liu'bu'ka kunani, ata milele na milele.” <verse eid="REV 19:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 19:4" />Na balu' agoi isilini nansese pamope na balu' yumbe bene ukoti ngabatu'mbu'ka wakukama kunkilikitya Nnu'ngu' ywatami pakiti'gu' sake sa lenji, kababaya kwa lilobe liku'lu', “Amina! Alumbilwe Nnu'ngu'!”<verse eid="REV 19:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 19:5" />Bu'kapo ngalipitya lilobe bu'ka pakiti'gu' sa lenji kalibaya, “Munnumbe Nnu'ngu' mwenga mwaatumisi bake, mwaboti mwamunkilikitya, agoi kwa anangu'ta!”<verse eid="REV 19:5" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kalamu ya lisengele lya Mwana Ngondolo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 19:6" />Kai', nganiyu'wa lilobe kati kipi'nga kiku'lu' sa bandu, na kati mwagayota masi' gambone gagabutuka na kati mwago wa njai, kabapanga ndu'ti baya, “Nnu'ngu' alumbilwe! Kwa mwanjaa Bwana Nnu'ngu' witu Mwene Makakala Goti endatawala! <verse eid="REV 19:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 19:7" />Tupulaike no u'pi'la, tumpei utukupu! Kwa mwanjaa lisengele lya Mwana Ngondolo liikite, na ywaku'nda ayomwike kwibi'ka wiso. <verse eid="REV 19:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 19:8" />Na ywembe apeyilwe uweso wo wala ngu'bo ya kitani uu yaipeletike na yaing'alang'atya!” (Ngu'bo yo ya kitani uu ilaya yendo inannoga ya bandu bake Nnu'ngu'.)<verse eid="REV 19:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 19:9" />Bu'kapo malaika nganibakia, “Uandike ga. Nantali balu' babakokilwe kulisengele lya Mwana Ngondolo!” Na ywembe ngayongeya baya, “Aga nga mayi'gi'yo ga kakape ga Nnu'ngu'.” <verse eid="REV 19:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 19:10" />Apo nganitu'mbu'ka wakukama mumagu'lu' gake li'nga kunkilikitya, lakini ywembe nganibakia, “Kaneupange nyo! Ata nenga nantumisi kati wenga, pamope na alongobo babankong'ondelya Yesu. Unkilikiti Nnu'ngu'! Kwa mwanjaa, ukong'ondeli bu'kana na Yesu nga kitumbu sa ulondoli.”<verse eid="REV 19:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Falasi mmu na mmwu'bu'ki</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 19:11" />Bu'kapo nganikubona kunani kuyu'gwike na nnu'ngi' yangu' aabile falasi mmu, na yu'lu' ywamwu'bwike aakemilwe “Mwu'bi'li'ka” na “Wa kakape.” Aywo endaukumu no ku'mbwana ngondo kwa aki. <verse eid="REV 19:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 19:12" />Minyo gake nga kati malimi ga mwoto na panani ya ntwe wake kubile na mataji gambone. Aandikilwe lina lyangalitanganikwa na mundu ywi'ngi', ila mwene kisake. <verse eid="REV 19:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 19:13" />Aawati nganju yaisuyilwe mumyai, na ywembe akemelwa, “Liyi'gi'yo lya Nnu'ngu'.” <verse eid="REV 19:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 19:14" />Mayesi ba kunani baatikunki'ngama, bau'bwike falasi bauu, ku'no baweti ngu'bo ya kitani mbeleteu, uu na inannoga. <verse eid="REV 19:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 19:15" />Munkano wake lipita lipanga linantema, kwa lipanga lyo alu'a kugatu'mbu'ya mataipwa. <char style="qt">Na ywembe aalu'a kugatawala kwa pimbo ya kyu'ma</char> no li'bata divai musombo sakilaya nyongo ngu'lu' ya Nnu'ngu' Mwene Makakala Goti. <verse eid="REV 19:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="REV 19:16" />Munganju yake na mulibando lyake mwaandikilwe lina li', “Nkulungwa wa akulungwa na Bwana wa Mabwana.”<verse eid="REV 19:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="REV 19:17" />Na nenga nganimmona malaika ayi'mi mulisu'ba, ngaakema iyuni boti babagu'lu'ka kwa lilobe liku'lu', “Mwise, mukongoleke kwa kitumbu sa kalamu ngu'lu' ya Nnu'ngu', <verse eid="REV 19:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="REV 19:18" />mwise li'nga mupate lya nyama ya akulungwa, agoi ba ngondo, ya bandu bene makakala, nyama ya falasi na yaau'bu'ka falasi, nnyama ya bandu boti, ya abanda na ya angwana, ya agoi na anangu'ta.”<verse eid="REV 19:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="REV 19:19" />Bu'kapo nganimmona yu'lu' kinyama na akulungwa wa dunia pamope na mayesi gabe bakongolekine pamope li'nga ku'mbwana ngondo na yu'lu' ywaamwu'bwike falasi pamope na yesi lyake. <verse eid="REV 19:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="REV 19:20" />Lakini yu'lu' kinyama ngaboyolwa pamope na aywo nnondoli ywa ubu'su' ywapangage mangelongelo kwa kitumbu sa kinyama ywo. Kwa mangelongelo go aakongite balu' babaapoki alama ya aywo kinyama na kuikilikitya inyago yake. Abi'li' ba ngabataikulwa babile akoti mulitanda lya mwoto lyaliyaka kwa bwaluti. <verse eid="REV 19:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="REV 19:21" />Na mayesi gabe ngagabulagilwa kwa lipanga lyalyabu'i munkano wa yu'lu' ywamwu'bwike falasi, na iyuni yoti ngaiyukuta kwa nyama yabe.<verse eid="REV 19:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 19" />
  <chapter number="20" style="c" sid="REV 20" />
  <para style="s">Myaka elupu yimo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 20:1" />Bu'kapo nganimmona malaika kaelya bu'ka kunani, akamwile kiyu'gu'lyo sa kumambi' na nyololo ngu'lu' muluboko lwake. <verse eid="REV 20:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 20:2" />Ngammoywa yu'lu' nng'ambo nku'lu', nng'ambo ywa kwai'mbu', ywaakemilwe Ibilisi au Setani, ngantaba kwa myaka elupu yimo. <verse eid="REV 20:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 20:3" />Malaika ngantaikulya kumambi', no yigala nniango wo yingya mo no yi'ya muuli, li'nga kaneayendeli kai' kugaobeya mataipwa mpaka payatimya myaka elupu yimo. Lakini bu'ka pamyaka yo aapalikwa yu'gu'li'lwa kai', lakini kwa masu'ba masini bai.<verse eid="REV 20:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 20:4" />Bu'kapo nganiibona iti'gu' ya lenji, yabaatami abo babapeyilwe uweso wo ukumu, na abo nga yi'lu' loo ya babaakatilwe mitwe kwa kitumbu sa ukong'ondeli wa Yesu na kwa liyi'gi'yo lya Nnu'ngu'. Balu' babaakotwike kunkilikitya yu'lu' kinyama wala inyago yake, baayi'ki'tili bi'ki'lwa alama ya kinyama ywo muibu'ngi' yabe, au panani ya maboko gabe. Bandu ba baatiyu'ka ngabatawala pamope na Kilisitu myaka elupu yimo. <verse eid="REV 20:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 20:5" />(Awi'li babaigalile baayu'kiteli mpaka paitimile ayo myaka elupu yimo.) Awu' nga uyu'ki nnongoi. <verse eid="REV 20:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 20:6" />Babayaliwite na babapeletike nga balu' bababile na pandu muuyu'ki nnongoi. Bu'kana na kiwo senebi'li', kipanga ntu'pu' makakala, ila baalu'a baa api'ndo ba dini ya Nnu'ngu' na ba Kilisitu, na baalu'a tawala pamope nakwe kwa myaka elupu yimo.<verse eid="REV 20:6" /></para>
  <para style="s">Langamiswa kwa Ibilisi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 20:7" />Bu'ka payatimya myaka elupu yimo, Ibilisi aalu'a yu'gu'li'lwa bu'ka muutabilwe wake. <verse eid="REV 20:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 20:8" />Na ywembe ngaalu'a pitya panja li'nga kugakonga mataipwa gagabile lwingo lwoti lwa dunia, lombolya Gogu na Magogu. Ibilisi aalu'a kwakongolya pamope kwa ngondo, nabembe baapanga bambone kati lwangi lwa kumbwani. <verse eid="REV 20:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 20:9" />Nabembe ngabatyanga kila pandu padunia, kabati'li'ta maema ga apeleteu, yani wu'lu' muyi waupendilwe na Nnu'ngu'. Lakini mwoto ngauelya bu'ka kunani na kwalangamisa. <verse eid="REV 20:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 20:10" />Na ywembe Ibilisi ywaakongite ngataikulwa mulitanda lya mwoto na bwaluti, pabaataikulilwe yu'lu' kinyama na yu'lu' nnondoli wa ubu'su'. Baalu'a ku'su'mbu'lwa mo kilo na mutwekati, milele na milele.<verse eid="REV 20:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ukumu ya kuundi'la</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 20:11" />Bu'kapo nganikibona kiti'gu' kiku'lu' sa lenji kiuu, na yu'lu' ywatami panani yake. Dunia na kunani ngakubu'ki'ka nnu'ngi' ya minyo gake, na yaabonekineli kai'. <verse eid="REV 20:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 20:12" />Bu'kapo nganaabona awi'li agoi kwa anangu'ta, bayi'mi nnu'ngi' ya aso kiti'gu' sa lenji na itabu ngaiyu'gu'li'lwa. Bu'kapo kitabu si'ngi' sa ukoti ngakiyu'gu'li'lwa. Abo awi'li ngabaukumilwa sawasawa na iyendo yabe kati mwaiandikilwe nkati ya itabu yo. <verse eid="REV 20:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 20:13" />Baali ngayaapiya awi'li babaabile nkati yake, na kiwo na kumambi' ngakwaapiya awi'li bake babaabile nkati yake. Kila mundu ngaukumilwa bu'kana na iyendo yake yaapangite. <verse eid="REV 20:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 20:14" />Bu'ka pa go, kiwo na kumambi' ngakutaikulwa mulitanda lya mwoto, alyo litanda nga kiwo senebi'li'. <verse eid="REV 20:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 20:15" />Mundu ywoywoti ywangalibonekana lina lyake mukitabu sa ukoti, aataikulilwa mulitanda lya mwoto.<verse eid="REV 20:15" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 20" />
  <chapter number="21" style="c" sid="REV 21" />
  <para style="s">Kunani kwaayambi' na dunia yayambi'</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 21:1" />Bu'kapo nganikubona kunani kwaayambi' na dunia yayambi', kwa mwanjaa kunani kulongoi na dunia nongoi iyomwike pi'ta, na baali yaabileli kai'. <verse eid="REV 21:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 21:2" />Nganiubona Muyi Mpeleteu, Yelusalemu yayambi', kawelya bu'ka kunani kwa Nnu'ngu', uyomwike nemekelwa kati nnwawa ywaku'nda kanni'nda nsengowe. <verse eid="REV 21:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 21:3" />Na nenga nganiyu'wa lilobe liku'lu' bu'ka musi'lu' kiti'gu' sa lenji kalibaya, “Nambi'yambi' potamo wa Nnu'ngu' nga pamope na bandu, na ywembe alu'a tama pamope nabo. Bembe baalu'a panga bandu bake, na Nnu'ngu' mwene aapanga pamope nabo, na aalu'a panga Nnu'ngu' wabe. <verse eid="REV 21:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 21:4" />Ywembe aalu'a ponwa moli gabe goti, nsimu wo bandu baawali wala usunika, kili'lo wala minya, kwa mwanjaa ube wo wa kwai'mbu' upite.”<verse eid="REV 21:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 21:5" />Na ywembe yu'lu' ywatami panani ya si'lu' kiti'gu' sa lenji ngabaya, “Lingulya, nipanga makowe ga goti baa gayambi'!” Kai' ngabaya, “Uandike makowe ga, kwa mwanjaa nga go aminika na ga kakape.” <verse eid="REV 21:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 21:6" />Nganibakia kai', “Gatimile! Nenga nga na Alfa na Omega, na Nnongoi na ywa Kuundi'la. Ywembe ywabile na nnyota, naalu'a kumpeya wabule masi' ga ukoti bu'ka mukinywanyu. <verse eid="REV 21:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 21:7" />Balu' boti babaalu'a sinda baalu'a pokya aga goti, na naalu'a panga Nnu'ngu' wabe na bembe baalu'a panga bana bangu'. <verse eid="REV 21:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 21:8" />Lakini bandu bene bwoga, bangau'bi'lya, asapu, bababulaga, apege, babi', babakilikitya inyago, pamope na abu'su' boti, bembe pandu pabe mulitanda lyaliyaka mwoto na bwaluti. Asi' nga kiwo senebi'li'.”<verse eid="REV 21:8" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yelusalemu yayambi'</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 21:9" />Bu'kapo yumo ywa balu' malaika saba babaabile na mabakuli saba gagaatwi'li malanganyiko saba ga kuundi'la ngaisa kunibakia, “Wise, na nenga nilu'a kulaya ywaku'nda, lombolya nnyumbo wa Mwana Ngondolo.” <verse eid="REV 21:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 21:10" />Bu'kapo yu'lu' malaika nganipu'twa kwa Loo Mpeleteu, nganipeleka mpaka kukitu'mbi' kiku'lu' na kilaso, nganilaya muyi mpeleteu wa Yelusalemu, kawelya bu'ka kunani kwa Nnu'ngu'. <verse eid="REV 21:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 21:11" />Waabile kaung'alang'atya kwa utukupu wa Nnu'ngu' kati liwe lya samani muno, kati yaspi, yaimelemetya kati kilolo. <verse eid="REV 21:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 21:12" />Kwaabile na kingu'mbi' kiku'lu' na kilaso na saai na milyango ku'mi na ibi'li', na kila nniango waabile kauli'ndi'li'lwa na malaika yumo. Mumilyango yo paandikilwe maina ga makabila ku'mi na ibi'li' ga Isilaili. <verse eid="REV 21:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 21:13" />Kwaabile na milyango itatu kwa lwingo lwa kumbwani, itatu lwingo lwa kibu'la, itatu lwingo lwa kusi na itatu ya lwingo lwa kundondi. <verse eid="REV 21:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 21:14" />Ingu'mbi' ya awo muyi yaabile na misingi ku'mi na ibi'li', na panani yake paandikilwe maina ga balu' atumilwe ku'mi na abi'li' ba Mwana Ngondolo.<verse eid="REV 21:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 21:15" />Aywo malaika ywalongelage na nenga aakamwi pimbo ya zaabu yo li'ngya awo muyi, li'ngya milyango yake na ingu'mbi' yake. <verse eid="REV 21:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="REV 21:16" />Muyi wo waabile na mbande nsese yailandana. Ulaso wake na bwipi wake waabile nsawani. Ngauli'nga awo muyi kwa ayo pimbo, nawembe waabile na ulaso, bwipi na kyi'mo kunako kilomita 2,400. <verse eid="REV 21:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="REV 21:17" />Ngali'nga kingu'mbi' sake, saabile na mita 60. Aywo malaika atumyage kili'ngo sabayobeli bandu li'ngya. <verse eid="REV 21:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="REV 21:18" />Kingu'mbi' so sasengilwe kwa maliwe ga samani ga yaspi, na muyi wene wasengilwe kwa zaabu mbeleteu yaing'alang'atya kati kilolo. <verse eid="REV 21:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="REV 21:19" />Misingi ya ingu'mbi' ya muyi wo yanemekilwe kwa kila sampuli ya maliwe ga samani ngu'lu'. Nsingi nnongoi waabile liwe lya samani lya yaspi, na lyenebi'li' liwe lya safilo, lyenetatu lyabile liwe lyalikemelwa kalikedoni na lyene nsese lyai liwe lya zumalidi, <verse eid="REV 21:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="REV 21:20" />lya tano lyaai liwe lya saldoniki, lya sita lyaai liwe lya akiki na lya saba lyaai krisolito, lya nane lyaai zabarajadi, lya tisa lyaai topazi, lya ku'mi lyaai krisoplaso, lya ku'mi na moja lyaai lya hiakinitho na lya ku'mi nebi'li' lyaai amethisito. <verse eid="REV 21:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="REV 21:21" />Yi'lu' milyango ku'mi na ibi'li' yaabile lulu ku'mi na ibi'li', kila nniango gumo waabile utengenesilwe kwa lulu yimo. Ndi'la ngu'lu' ya muyi wo yaabile ya zaabu mbeleteu yaimelemetya kati kilolo.<verse eid="REV 21:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="REV 21:22" />Nkati ya awo muyi naaibwenili nyumba ya Nnu'ngu', kwa mwanjaa Bwana Nnu'ngu' Mwene Makakala Goti na Mwana Ngondolo nga Nyumba ya Nnu'ngu'. <verse eid="REV 21:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="REV 21:23" />Wu'lu' muyi upalali bweya wa lisu'ba wala mwei, kwa mwanjaa utukupu wa Nnu'ngu' nga bweya wake na Mwana Ngondolo nga kimulikyo sake. <verse eid="REV 21:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="REV 21:24" />Mataipwa gaalu'a tyanga mubweya wake, na akulungwa ba dunia baaleta utayili wabe nkati yake. <verse eid="REV 21:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="REV 21:25" />Milyango yake katu yaayigalilwali, kwa mwanjaa kwaapilyali. <verse eid="REV 21:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="REV 21:26" />Bandu ba mataipwa goti padunia baalu'a leta utayili wabe na ili'be yabe ya samani nkati ya muyi wo. <verse eid="REV 21:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="REV 21:27" />Lakini kili'be kisapu katu saayingyali mo, wala mundu ywoywoti ywapanga makowe ga oni au ga ubu'su'. Ila babaalu'a yingya mo nga balu' babaandikilwe maina gabe mukitabu sa ukoto sa Mwana Ngondolo.<verse eid="REV 21:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 21" />
  <chapter number="22" style="c" sid="REV 22" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 22:1" />Bu'kapo yu'lu' malaika nganilaya libi'ndi' lya masi' ga ukoto, gagamelemetya kati kilolo kagabutuka bu'ka musi'lu' kiti'gu' sa lenji sa Nnu'ngu' na sa Mwana Ngondolo, <verse eid="REV 22:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 22:2" />pi'tya pakatikati ya ndi'la ngu'lu' ya muyi wo. Mulwingo lwoti lwa libi'ndi' kwaabile na nkongo wa ukoti waupiya itunda ya sampuli ku'mi na ibi'li', upambiya itunda yake kila mwei, na maakapi ga nkongo wo nga ntela wa kugatepwa mataipwa. <verse eid="REV 22:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 22:3" />Ntu'pu' kili'be sosoti sakikosite lasi sasaalu'a yingya mumuyi wo.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="REV 22:3">Na kiti'gu' si'lu' sa lenji sa Nnu'ngu' na Mwana Ngondolo saalu'a baa mumuyi wo, na atumisi bake baalu'a kunkilikitya Nnu'ngu'. <verse eid="REV 22:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 22:4" />Na bembe baalu'a kummona kuminyo yake na lina lyake lyaandikilwa muibu'ngi' yabe. <verse eid="REV 22:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 22:5" />Kilo saalu'a bali kai', wala baalu'a palali bweya wa kimulikyo au lumu, kwa mwanjaa Bwana Nnu'ngu' aalu'a panga bweya wabe, na bembe baalu'a tawala milele na milele.<verse eid="REV 22:5" /></para>
  <para style="s">Isa kwa Yesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 22:6" />Bu'kapo yu'lu' malaika nganibakia, “Mayi'gi'yo ga nga ga kakape na go u'bi'li'ka. Bwana Nnu'ngu' ywaalongoya alondoli aatumike malaika bake kwalaya atumisi bake galu' gagapalikwa pitya masu'ba gaganogano.”<verse eid="REV 22:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 22:7" />Yesu endabaya, “Lingulya, niisa kiyu'ngu'ya! Nantali yake yu'lu' ywagakamwa mayi'gi'yo ga ulondoli wa kitabu si'no.”<verse eid="REV 22:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 22:8" />Nenga na Yoani, ngaywanigayu'wine na kugabona makowe ga. Na nenga paniyomwike yu'wa na kugabona, naatu'i pai' nganikilikita pamagu'lu' ga yu'lu' malaika ywaabile kanilaya makowe go. <verse eid="REV 22:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 22:9" />Lakini ywembe nganibakia, “Kaneupange nyo, nenga na ntumisi pamope nawenga na alongobo alondoli, na boti babagakamwa mayi'gi'yo ga kitabu si'. Bai, unkilikiti Nnu'ngu'!” <verse eid="REV 22:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 22:10" />Nganibakia kai', “Kaneugaiye mayi'gi'yo ga kilondoli gagabile mukitabu si', kwa mwanjaa nsimu wo timya makowe go wegelile. <verse eid="REV 22:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 22:11" />Bai, mundu ywapanga manyatau ayendeli panga, na ywabile nsapu ayendeli baa nsapu. Mundu ywapanga makowe ga aki, na ywembe ayendeli panga ga aki, na ywabile mpeleteu, na ayendeli baa mpeleteu.”<verse eid="REV 22:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 22:12" />Yesu endabaya, “Lingulya, niisa kiyu'ngu'ya! Upo yangu' ibile mumaboko gangu', na nenga naalu'a kumpeya kila mundu bu'kana na mwapangite. <verse eid="REV 22:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 22:13" />Nenga nga na Alfa na Omega, na Nnongoi na ywa Kuundi'la, Ntumbuli na Nnyomoli.”<verse eid="REV 22:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 22:14" />Nantali yabe balu' babakusa makanju gabe, li'nga bapate aki ya kuuyendelya awo nkongo wa ukoti na kuuyingya awo muyi kwo pi'tya mumilyango yake. <verse eid="REV 22:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 22:15" />Lakini panja ya muyi ngabatama bandu bene iyendo kati ya mbwa, babi', apege, abulagi, babakilikitya inyago na bi'ngi' babapenda longela ubu'su' na kwipanga anogau.<verse eid="REV 22:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="REV 22:16" />“Nenga na Yesu, nintumike malaika wangu' kukubakia makowe ga kwa kitumbu sa makanisa. Nenga nga na Mmelekwe wa lukolo lwa Daudi. Nenga nga na Ndondwa ya kindai' yaing'alang'atya muno.”<verse eid="REV 22:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="REV 22:17" />Loo ywa Nnu'ngu' na ywaku'nda babaya, “Wise!” Na kila mundu ywayu'wa li', na abaye, “Wise!” Ywabile na nnyota, aise, na kila ywapala masi' ga ukoti anywe wabule.<verse eid="REV 22:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kuundi'la</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="REV 22:18" />Ninkwi'li'ka kila mundu ywayu'wa mayi'gi'yo ga ulondoli wa kitabu si', mundu ywoywoti mana ayongiye sosoti mumakowe ga, Nnu'ngu' aalu'a kunnyongeya malanganyiko gagabayilwe mukitabu si'. <verse eid="REV 22:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="REV 22:19" />Na mundu ywoywoti mana apu'ngwiye sosoti mumayi'gi'yo ga ulondoli wa mukitabu si', Nnu'ngu' aalu'a kumpokonywa aki yake yo lya itunda ya nkongo wa ukoti na aki yake yo tama mumuyi mpeleteu yaibayilwe mukitabu si'. <verse eid="REV 22:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="REV 22:20" />Na ywapiya ukong'ondeli wake bu'kana na makowe ga abaya, “Kakape, niisa kiyu'ngu'ya.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="REV 22:20">Amina. Wise wa Bwana Yesu!<verse eid="REV 22:20" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="REV 22:21" />Ninnu'bya mwaboti ngu'ngu' bu'ka kwa Bwana Yesu, Amina.<verse eid="REV 22:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 22" />
</usx>